{"jobs":[{"id":"575c045f-fbef-4889-b558-a3c2bd6b60d6","title":"Founding Engineer","department":"Engineering","team":"Engineering","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"San Francisco","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2025-12-17T08:09:53.104+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":false,"workplaceType":"OnSite","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"California","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"San Francisco"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/575c045f-fbef-4889-b558-a3c2bd6b60d6","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/575c045f-fbef-4889-b558-a3c2bd6b60d6/application","descriptionHtml":"<h1>Founding Engineer</h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1>The Role</h1><h3>You will:</h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own and scale the recruitment engine, the algorithm that finds any niche audience in the world through network traversal targeted ads, referrals, automated outbound, and anything else you can come up with.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build and extend the Terac API that research tooling companies and AI data companies integrate against.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ship the AI moderator, our voice agent that screens candidates, evaluates long-horizon tasks, detects cheating, and handles multi-language conversations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build marketplace systems: opportunity routing, pricing optimization, expert LTV modeling, and feasibility estimation.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design the expert network experience, including onboarding flows, opportunity matching, payouts, and trust systems that make experts want to stay on the platform.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work directly with the CTO to shape technical direction across Next.js, TypeScript, tRPC, Drizzle, Neon Postgres, LiveKit, and the Vercel AI SDK.</p></li></ul><h3>You are:</h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A high-agency builder with 3+ years of fullstack experience.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fluent in modern web stacks (TypeScript, React, Postgres).</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experienced with LLMs, voice AI, or AI SDKs (Vercel AI SDK, Gemini, LiveKit).</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excited by marketplace dynamics like matching, routing, pricing, and network effects.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maybe a former founder or lead who is hungry to build again.</p></li></ul><h3>Why now:</h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are at the inflection point, shifting from a research tool into a platform company with 10+ API integrations launching in the next quarter.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The human data market for AI training is exploding and we have the recruitment infrastructure already built.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You would be joining a 10-person team with 9M in funding and a growing base of happy customers.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>Misc</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Compensation: </strong>Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Terac culture: </strong>Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you will be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You are joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"FOUNDING ENGINEER\n\nTerac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.\n\nWe work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.\n\n\n\n\nTHE ROLE\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Own and scale the recruitment engine, the algorithm that finds any niche audience in the world through network traversal targeted ads, referrals, automated outbound, and anything else you can come up with.\n\n - Build and extend the Terac API that research tooling companies and AI data companies integrate against.\n\n - Ship the AI moderator, our voice agent that screens candidates, evaluates long-horizon tasks, detects cheating, and handles multi-language conversations.\n\n - Build marketplace systems: opportunity routing, pricing optimization, expert LTV modeling, and feasibility estimation.\n\n - Design the expert network experience, including onboarding flows, opportunity matching, payouts, and trust systems that make experts want to stay on the platform.\n\n - Work directly with the CTO to shape technical direction across Next.js, TypeScript, tRPC, Drizzle, Neon Postgres, LiveKit, and the Vercel AI SDK.\n\n\nYOU ARE:\n\n - A high-agency builder with 3+ years of fullstack experience.\n\n - Fluent in modern web stacks (TypeScript, React, Postgres).\n\n - Experienced with LLMs, voice AI, or AI SDKs (Vercel AI SDK, Gemini, LiveKit).\n\n - Excited by marketplace dynamics like matching, routing, pricing, and network effects.\n\n - Maybe a former founder or lead who is hungry to build again.\n\n\nWHY NOW:\n\n - We are at the inflection point, shifting from a research tool into a platform company with 10+ API integrations launching in the next quarter.\n\n - The human data market for AI training is exploding and we have the recruitment infrastructure already built.\n\n - You would be joining a 10-person team with 9M in funding and a growing base of happy customers.\n\n\n\n\nMISC\n\n - Compensation: Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match\n\n - Terac culture: Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you will be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.\n\n - Growth opportunities: You are joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$140K – $210K • Offers Equity • Offers Commission","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":"$140K - $210K","compensationTiers":[{"id":"329141b0-e5aa-440b-a3de-6271acb5eef0","tierSummary":"$140K – $210K • Offers Equity • Offers Commission","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"ad473a98-052d-47cc-b2c5-eef83608260d","summary":"$140K – $210K","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":140000,"maxValue":210000},{"id":"5af74a42-12ff-401f-9368-5abce3693c69","summary":"Offers Equity","compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"2c104445-e967-4c47-909e-b03541131858","summary":"Offers Commission","compensationType":"Commission","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":140000,"maxValue":210000},{"compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":0},{"compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Commission","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}},{"id":"df3d85f6-1627-44f5-8381-fecfaeb4a75d","title":"Previous Study Participants: Brazilian Banking Follow-Up Survey","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"Brazil","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-27T01:25:09.459+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"Brazil"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/df3d85f6-1627-44f5-8381-fecfaeb4a75d","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/df3d85f6-1627-44f5-8381-fecfaeb4a75d/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid follow-up study to gather additional data on consumer banking habits in Brazil. This survey builds directly on the feedback collected during our initial research phase. Your continued input helps clarify the trends and preferences defining modern financial services.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will complete an asynchronous, remote survey focused on your personal banking routines. The questions will prompt you to expand on specific financial tools and account features you use regularly. You can finish this task entirely on your own schedule from your computer or mobile device. We will review your written responses to finalize our understanding of the current banking landscape.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are exclusively looking for individuals who successfully completed our initial Brazilian Banking study. You should have active, ongoing experience managing personal or business finances with major banks in Brazil. We welcome retail banking customers, small business owners, and active investors who participated previously.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete a short remote questionnaire on your daily financial habits</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expand on the feedback you provided during the initial banking study</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Detail the specific tools or mobile applications you use to manage your accounts</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Submit clear written responses independently on your own schedule</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Confirmed participation in the prior Brazilian Banking research study</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Active user of consumer financial services or banking apps in Brazil</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable providing clear written feedback about your financial routines</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to a computer or mobile device to complete an asynchronous survey</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$28 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/094a0b59-9342-495c-820e-afaa42b304a8?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid follow-up study to gather additional data on consumer banking habits in Brazil. This survey builds directly on the feedback collected during our initial research phase. Your continued input helps clarify the trends and preferences defining modern financial services.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will complete an asynchronous, remote survey focused on your personal banking routines. The questions will prompt you to expand on specific financial tools and account features you use regularly. You can finish this task entirely on your own schedule from your computer or mobile device. We will review your written responses to finalize our understanding of the current banking landscape.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are exclusively looking for individuals who successfully completed our initial Brazilian Banking study. You should have active, ongoing experience managing personal or business finances with major banks in Brazil. We welcome retail banking customers, small business owners, and active investors who participated previously.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Complete a short remote questionnaire on your daily financial habits\n\n - Expand on the feedback you provided during the initial banking study\n\n - Detail the specific tools or mobile applications you use to manage your accounts\n\n - Submit clear written responses independently on your own schedule\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Confirmed participation in the prior Brazilian Banking research study\n\n - Active user of consumer financial services or banking apps in Brazil\n\n - Comfortable providing clear written feedback about your financial routines\n\n - Access to a computer or mobile device to complete an asynchronous survey\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$28 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/094a0b59-9342-495c-820e-afaa42b304a8?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"1f185bbb-fbca-4c4d-9bb8-2d58ad7bc6aa","title":"Founding Operations","department":"Operations","team":"Operations","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"San Francisco","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-02-24T09:36:12.759+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":false,"workplaceType":"OnSite","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"California","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"San Francisco"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/1f185bbb-fbca-4c4d-9bb8-2d58ad7bc6aa","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/1f185bbb-fbca-4c4d-9bb8-2d58ad7bc6aa/application","descriptionHtml":"<h1><strong>Terac: The Expert Network Powering Frontier Research</strong></h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>About the role:</strong></h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for a founding operator to partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the company’s core functions. You will work on the highest-priority problems in the company including managing key customer relationships, building out the founding team, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>You will:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinate the delivery of our highest-value projects</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with the CEO to drive important business decisions</p></li></ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure execution under demanding timelines</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with every single member of the team.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>You have/are:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Background in consulting, finance, startups, or other operationally intense environments.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical and communication abilities; proven track record of managing complex projects.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excited by “gritty” process optimization and large-scale execution.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Misc</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We operate in-person six days per week in our downtown SF office</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Compensation: </strong>Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Terac culture: </strong>Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"TERAC: THE EXPERT NETWORK POWERING FRONTIER RESEARCH\n\nTerac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.\n\nWe work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE:\n\nWe're looking for a founding operator to partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the company’s core functions. You will work on the highest-priority problems in the company including managing key customer relationships, building out the founding team, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nYou're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.\n\n\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Coordinate the delivery of our highest-value projects\n\n - Work with the CEO to drive important business decisions\n\n - Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform\n\n - Ensure execution under demanding timelines\n\n - Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency.\n\n - Work with every single member of the team.\n   \n   \n\n\nYOU HAVE/ARE:\n\n - Background in consulting, finance, startups, or other operationally intense environments.\n\n - Strong analytical and communication abilities; proven track record of managing complex projects.\n\n - Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.\n\n - Excited by “gritty” process optimization and large-scale execution.\n   \n   \n\n\nMISC\n\n - We operate in-person six days per week in our downtown SF office\n\n - Compensation: Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match\n\n - Terac culture: Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$120K – $160K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":"$120K - $160K","compensationTiers":[{"id":"d3643d32-b7fe-4b2a-a758-afcb6bfeaf17","tierSummary":"$120K – $160K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"ad33ad0d-8d93-4e73-871a-bf5c63012ae4","summary":"$120K – $160K","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":120000,"maxValue":160000},{"id":"92c06767-018a-4efb-870d-af8d5cc25548","summary":"Offers Equity","compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"0bc137b6-a35e-4365-923c-8100a7e72e48","summary":"Offers Bonus","compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":120000,"maxValue":160000},{"compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}},{"id":"a0041d24-7a8f-4c9b-ab9d-e3ddbeafd120","title":"CAD Engineers: Parametric Modeling and Modification Tasks","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-22T21:27:29.795+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/a0041d24-7a8f-4c9b-ab9d-e3ddbeafd120","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/a0041d24-7a8f-4c9b-ab9d-e3ddbeafd120/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're hiring skilled CAD engineers to develop realistic parametric models and corresponding engineering modification tasks. This paid study focuses on evaluating how engineering designs are structured and modified within open-source environments. Your work will directly support our internal testing and development of mechanical design workflows.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will review technical briefs detailing specific engineering constraints and modification scenarios. From there, you will construct detailed parametric models that meet those technical requirements. Once the initial modeling is complete, you will document the required engineering modification tasks. All final submissions must be delivered as native, editable FreeCAD files.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome mechanical engineers, product designers, and CAD specialists with professional modeling experience. While a background in major platforms like SolidWorks, NX, or Fusion 360 is expected, you must be comfortable delivering final files via FreeCAD. Candidates should have a strong grasp of parametric design principles and standard mechanical engineering practices.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review technical briefs for parametric modeling assignments</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design realistic mechanical models from scratch using proper constraints</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Formulate specific engineering modification tasks based on your models</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Export and submit all deliverables in the native FreeCAD file format</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Professional experience in mechanical engineering or industrial design</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency with parametric CAD software (SolidWorks, NX, Fusion 360, or similar)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to create and deliver native, editable FreeCAD files</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of mechanical constraints and design history</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$300 one-time</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/19866222-c5b3-4b13-88a4-feb31f493de3?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're hiring skilled CAD engineers to develop realistic parametric models and corresponding engineering modification tasks. This paid study focuses on evaluating how engineering designs are structured and modified within open-source environments. Your work will directly support our internal testing and development of mechanical design workflows.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will review technical briefs detailing specific engineering constraints and modification scenarios. From there, you will construct detailed parametric models that meet those technical requirements. Once the initial modeling is complete, you will document the required engineering modification tasks. All final submissions must be delivered as native, editable FreeCAD files.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe welcome mechanical engineers, product designers, and CAD specialists with professional modeling experience. While a background in major platforms like SolidWorks, NX, or Fusion 360 is expected, you must be comfortable delivering final files via FreeCAD. Candidates should have a strong grasp of parametric design principles and standard mechanical engineering practices.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Review technical briefs for parametric modeling assignments\n\n - Design realistic mechanical models from scratch using proper constraints\n\n - Formulate specific engineering modification tasks based on your models\n\n - Export and submit all deliverables in the native FreeCAD file format\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Professional experience in mechanical engineering or industrial design\n\n - Proficiency with parametric CAD software (SolidWorks, NX, Fusion 360, or similar)\n\n - Ability to create and deliver native, editable FreeCAD files\n\n - Strong understanding of mechanical constraints and design history\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$300 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/19866222-c5b3-4b13-88a4-feb31f493de3?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"0e97e938-287a-41d2-83e9-092cde42944d","title":"Finance Professionals: 15-Minute Survey on Investment Banks","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-04T18:38:12.241+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/0e97e938-287a-41d2-83e9-092cde42944d","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/0e97e938-287a-41d2-83e9-092cde42944d/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are running a paid study to understand market perceptions of major investment banks. Help us evaluate how different financial institutions are viewed by industry professionals and frequent clients. This feedback will shape a broader analysis of brand reputation and service familiarity across the banking sector.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will complete a brief 15-minute async survey from your own device. The questions will ask you to rate your familiarity with several top investment banks and describe your general impressions of their services. You will also provide quick written feedback on any direct experiences you have had working with or alongside these institutions. The process is fully text-based and can be completed at your own pace.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for finance professionals, corporate investors, and individuals who regularly track or interact with major investment banks. We welcome analysts, portfolio managers, corporate finance specialists, and adjacent roles in the financial sector. If you have a solid working knowledge of the top institutional players in the market, this study is a great fit.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete a 15-minute async survey regarding top investment banks.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Rate your familiarity with various financial institutions and their market presence.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Share your opinions and general impressions of major industry leaders.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Detail any direct experiences you have had with these banks, if applicable.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Professional background in finance, banking, or corporate investment.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with the services offered by top global investment banks.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable providing written feedback on financial brand reputation.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to draw on recent industry experience or market knowledge.</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$45 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/e748f3e7-f9ee-4e80-9d2e-8f206fc9fd31?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe are running a paid study to understand market perceptions of major investment banks. Help us evaluate how different financial institutions are viewed by industry professionals and frequent clients. This feedback will shape a broader analysis of brand reputation and service familiarity across the banking sector.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will complete a brief 15-minute async survey from your own device. The questions will ask you to rate your familiarity with several top investment banks and describe your general impressions of their services. You will also provide quick written feedback on any direct experiences you have had working with or alongside these institutions. The process is fully text-based and can be completed at your own pace.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are looking for finance professionals, corporate investors, and individuals who regularly track or interact with major investment banks. We welcome analysts, portfolio managers, corporate finance specialists, and adjacent roles in the financial sector. If you have a solid working knowledge of the top institutional players in the market, this study is a great fit.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Complete a 15-minute async survey regarding top investment banks.\n\n - Rate your familiarity with various financial institutions and their market presence.\n\n - Share your opinions and general impressions of major industry leaders.\n\n - Detail any direct experiences you have had with these banks, if applicable.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Professional background in finance, banking, or corporate investment.\n\n - Familiarity with the services offered by top global investment banks.\n\n - Comfortable providing written feedback on financial brand reputation.\n\n - Ability to draw on recent industry experience or market knowledge.\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$45 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/e748f3e7-f9ee-4e80-9d2e-8f206fc9fd31?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"44bc7549-9ef3-4c4f-b55f-468aaa12ef55","title":"Founding Growth","department":"Growth","team":"Growth","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"San Francisco","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-03-31T01:18:31.190+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":false,"workplaceType":"OnSite","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"California","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"San Francisco"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/44bc7549-9ef3-4c4f-b55f-468aaa12ef55","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/44bc7549-9ef3-4c4f-b55f-468aaa12ef55/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2><strong>About Terac</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the infrastructure for accessing human capability on demand. We are working toward a future where Terac deeply understands:</p><ol style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What every person is capable of, what they want, and where they can thrive</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What work our customers need completed and what success requires</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What creates a great match between the two</p></li></ol><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">With this understanding, Terac can intelligently allocate human capability to the work where it creates the most value for both our experts and customers. Today, our initial wedge is providing specialized experts for AI training, evaluation, market research, and other expert-driven research.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This future was not previously possible. Understanding people and work at this depth required more information and judgment than any organization could reasonably process. As a result, the labor market came to rely on crude proxies: résumés, credentials, applications, interviews, and personal networks. At Terac, we're changing this by making it possible to synthesize thousands of signals about a person’s knowledge, performance, preferences, and potential while developing an equally detailed understanding of the work itself.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We place 1,000s of experts per month, pay our experts, on average, over $90/hr. We're a team of 15 based in San Francisco, and we work with many leading research companies.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, Terac's projects team handles over 50 projects per month across 25+ clients. You will strategically focus on how we build our network to support the next 1,000 projects. You will partner directly with the CEO and Head of Projects to shape and scale the expert side of the marketplace. This is the consumer side of our marketplace and required unique understanding of targeting and growing communities in different niches.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>You will:</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Run expert acquisition: build and run marketing campaigns 24/7 that are targeting the highest-leverage domain experts we need at any given moment through ads, our referral network, event marketing, or any other method you can dream up.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be rigorously data-driven: You will manage a 7-figure budget and be tasked with acquiring millions of experts. It's vital we make informed decisions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build Terac's credibility: Between running our socials, engaging in Reddit/Discord communities, organizing roundtables, and being active in a dedicated Slack with our top experts it will be your job to drive credibility to the Terac brand and make being a Terac expert a sought after title.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Event marketing: we host monthly dinners for AI researchers, our top experts, and hackathons for our power users. You will travel across the country and the world representing Terac to the expert community.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h2><strong>You have:</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven experience in GTM, outbound sales, or growth roles</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated success owning pipelines and delivering results at scale</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong familiarity with LinkedIn Recruiter, Sales Navigator, and similar tools</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong judgment and ability to prioritize under pressure</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>You likely have experience in:</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Growth or strategy at early stage or high growth startups.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to marketplaces, platforms, or two-sided businesses.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Misc</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Compensation: </strong>Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"ABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the infrastructure for accessing human capability on demand. We are working toward a future where Terac deeply understands:\n\n 1. What every person is capable of, what they want, and where they can thrive\n\n 2. What work our customers need completed and what success requires\n\n 3. What creates a great match between the two\n\nWith this understanding, Terac can intelligently allocate human capability to the work where it creates the most value for both our experts and customers. Today, our initial wedge is providing specialized experts for AI training, evaluation, market research, and other expert-driven research.\n\nThis future was not previously possible. Understanding people and work at this depth required more information and judgment than any organization could reasonably process. As a result, the labor market came to rely on crude proxies: résumés, credentials, applications, interviews, and personal networks. At Terac, we're changing this by making it possible to synthesize thousands of signals about a person’s knowledge, performance, preferences, and potential while developing an equally detailed understanding of the work itself.\n\nWe place 1,000s of experts per month, pay our experts, on average, over $90/hr. We're a team of 15 based in San Francisco, and we work with many leading research companies.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nToday, Terac's projects team handles over 50 projects per month across 25+ clients. You will strategically focus on how we build our network to support the next 1,000 projects. You will partner directly with the CEO and Head of Projects to shape and scale the expert side of the marketplace. This is the consumer side of our marketplace and required unique understanding of targeting and growing communities in different niches.\n\nYou're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.\n\n\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Run expert acquisition: build and run marketing campaigns 24/7 that are targeting the highest-leverage domain experts we need at any given moment through ads, our referral network, event marketing, or any other method you can dream up.\n\n - Be rigorously data-driven: You will manage a 7-figure budget and be tasked with acquiring millions of experts. It's vital we make informed decisions.\n\n - Build Terac's credibility: Between running our socials, engaging in Reddit/Discord communities, organizing roundtables, and being active in a dedicated Slack with our top experts it will be your job to drive credibility to the Terac brand and make being a Terac expert a sought after title.\n\n - Event marketing: we host monthly dinners for AI researchers, our top experts, and hackathons for our power users. You will travel across the country and the world representing Terac to the expert community.\n   \n   \n\n\nYOU HAVE:\n\n - Proven experience in GTM, outbound sales, or growth roles\n\n - Demonstrated success owning pipelines and delivering results at scale\n\n - Strong familiarity with LinkedIn Recruiter, Sales Navigator, and similar tools\n\n - Strong judgment and ability to prioritize under pressure\n\n\n\n\nYOU LIKELY HAVE EXPERIENCE IN:\n\n - Growth or strategy at early stage or high growth startups.\n\n - Exposure to marketplaces, platforms, or two-sided businesses.\n\n\n\n\nMISC\n\n - Compensation: Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"6d992fab-a78a-4a06-be6c-9994e4ec079b","title":"Recruiting Coordinator","department":"Operations","team":"Operations","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"San Francisco","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-03-31T01:30:14.618+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":false,"workplaceType":"OnSite","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"California","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"San Francisco"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/6d992fab-a78a-4a06-be6c-9994e4ec079b","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/6d992fab-a78a-4a06-be6c-9994e4ec079b/application","descriptionHtml":"<h1><strong>Recruiting Coordinator</strong></h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1,000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>About the role:</strong></h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for recruitment coordinators to work directly with the sales and engineering team to build the most efficient recruiting systems in the market. You will work on the highest-priority accounts to source ad-hoc experts to the Terac panel.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>You will:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinate the delivery of experts to our highest-value projects</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with the CEO/CTO to design important recruitment frameworks</p></li></ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure execution under demanding timelines</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Continuously refine recruitment, onboarding, and activation funnels, using data to boost participant retention and engagement</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>You have/are:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience attracting world-class talent in short time frames.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Data-driven: You make data driven decisions. Like any marketplace, problems can balloon at scale. It's vital we track LTV, CAC, and measure everything to ensure we make informed decisions.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bias to action: You will operate with a high-level of agency. This means not every initiative will be discussed or thought out. We're looking for someone comfortable in failure, but can come to us with a list of initiatives where you tried something, measured the impact, and either doubled down or quit - all without permission</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Data-driven: You make data driven decisions. Like any marketplace, problems can balloon at scale. It's vital we track LTV, CAC, and measure everything to ensure we make informed decisions.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>Misc</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We operate in-person six days per week in our downtown SF office</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Compensation: </strong>Competitive salary, menaingful equity vested over four years, $15K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), $10K housing bonus (if you live within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Terac culture: </strong>Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"RECRUITING COORDINATOR\n\nTerac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1,000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.\n\nWe work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE:\n\nWe're looking for recruitment coordinators to work directly with the sales and engineering team to build the most efficient recruiting systems in the market. You will work on the highest-priority accounts to source ad-hoc experts to the Terac panel.\n\nYou're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.\n\n\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Coordinate the delivery of experts to our highest-value projects\n\n - Work with the CEO/CTO to design important recruitment frameworks\n\n - Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform\n\n - Ensure execution under demanding timelines\n\n - Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency\n\n - Continuously refine recruitment, onboarding, and activation funnels, using data to boost participant retention and engagement\n   \n   \n\n\nYOU HAVE/ARE:\n\n - Experience attracting world-class talent in short time frames.\n\n - Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.\n\n - Data-driven: You make data driven decisions. Like any marketplace, problems can balloon at scale. It's vital we track LTV, CAC, and measure everything to ensure we make informed decisions.\n\n - Bias to action: You will operate with a high-level of agency. This means not every initiative will be discussed or thought out. We're looking for someone comfortable in failure, but can come to us with a list of initiatives where you tried something, measured the impact, and either doubled down or quit - all without permission\n\n - Data-driven: You make data driven decisions. Like any marketplace, problems can balloon at scale. It's vital we track LTV, CAC, and measure everything to ensure we make informed decisions.\n\n\n\n\nMISC\n\n - We operate in-person six days per week in our downtown SF office\n\n - Compensation: Competitive salary, menaingful equity vested over four years, $15K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), $10K housing bonus (if you live within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match\n\n - Terac culture: Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$70K – $110K • Offers Equity • Offers Commission • Offers Bonus","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":"$70K - $110K","compensationTiers":[{"id":"96acede3-af02-46fc-9ec8-8154b9de1268","tierSummary":"$70K – $110K • Offers Equity • Offers Commission • Offers Bonus","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"074f20c4-fb81-478f-b161-a932ab2a5be8","summary":"$70K – $110K","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":70000,"maxValue":110000},{"id":"43e4303f-26cd-4c24-b633-155c63fa701f","summary":"Offers Equity","compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"d9daf811-04b1-4cb2-a516-c9d5e37da106","summary":"Offers Commission","compensationType":"Commission","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"ba0e5f35-75cc-49a3-968f-7ce2793e8b46","summary":"Offers Bonus","compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":70000,"maxValue":110000},{"compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Commission","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}},{"id":"37123c6d-3450-482f-a807-7b56b23b564d","title":"Recruiting Coordinator","department":"Operations","team":"Operations","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"Virtual","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-04-14T19:06:57.025+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressLocality":""}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/37123c6d-3450-482f-a807-7b56b23b564d","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/37123c6d-3450-482f-a807-7b56b23b564d/application","descriptionHtml":"<h1>Recruiting Coordinator - Virtual</h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1,000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>About the role:</strong></h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for recruitment coordinators to work directly with the sales and engineering team to build the most efficient recruiting systems in the market. You will work on the highest-priority accounts to source ad-hoc experts to the Terac panel.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>You will:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinate the delivery of experts to our highest-value projects</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with the CEO/CTO to design important recruitment frameworks</p></li></ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure execution under demanding timelines</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Continuously refine recruitment, onboarding, and activation funnels, using data to boost participant retention and engagement</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>You have/are:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience attracting world-class talent in short time frames.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bias to action: You will operate with a high-level of agency. This means not every initiative will be discussed or thought out. We're looking for someone comfortable in failure, but can come to us with a list of initiatives where you tried something, measured the impact, and either doubled down or quit - all without permission</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Data-driven: You make data driven decisions. Like any marketplace, problems can balloon at scale. It's vital we track LTV, CAC, and measure everything to ensure we make informed decisions.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>Misc</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We operate six days per week</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Terac culture: </strong>Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"RECRUITING COORDINATOR - VIRTUAL\n\nTerac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1,000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.\n\nWe work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE:\n\nWe're looking for recruitment coordinators to work directly with the sales and engineering team to build the most efficient recruiting systems in the market. You will work on the highest-priority accounts to source ad-hoc experts to the Terac panel.\n\nYou're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.\n\n\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Coordinate the delivery of experts to our highest-value projects\n\n - Work with the CEO/CTO to design important recruitment frameworks\n\n - Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform\n\n - Ensure execution under demanding timelines\n\n - Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency\n\n - Continuously refine recruitment, onboarding, and activation funnels, using data to boost participant retention and engagement\n   \n   \n\n\nYOU HAVE/ARE:\n\n - Experience attracting world-class talent in short time frames.\n\n - Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.\n\n - Bias to action: You will operate with a high-level of agency. This means not every initiative will be discussed or thought out. We're looking for someone comfortable in failure, but can come to us with a list of initiatives where you tried something, measured the impact, and either doubled down or quit - all without permission\n\n - Data-driven: You make data driven decisions. Like any marketplace, problems can balloon at scale. It's vital we track LTV, CAC, and measure everything to ensure we make informed decisions.\n\n\n\n\nMISC\n\n - We operate six days per week\n\n - Terac culture: Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$20K – $50K • Offers Commission • Offers Bonus","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":"$20K - $50K","compensationTiers":[{"id":"8c4422a2-3ecf-4b14-b91c-4bfb5bcd9f23","tierSummary":"$20K – $50K • Offers Commission • Offers Bonus","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"77fbfa24-f200-4ea6-8851-624a3e26b9cd","summary":"Offers Commission","compensationType":"Commission","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"9eff75a0-5e3c-4f6d-aa8d-a5398f418b98","summary":"Offers Bonus","compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"033dcf5e-58d3-4c9b-9edd-71a4672844a6","summary":"$20K – $50K","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":20000,"maxValue":50000}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Commission","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":20000,"maxValue":50000}]}},{"id":"6fdfacf7-a963-47ff-b312-01b0e1dceb3e","title":"Strategic Projects Associate","department":"Operations","team":"Operations","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"Virtual","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-04-14T19:10:07.860+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressLocality":""}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/6fdfacf7-a963-47ff-b312-01b0e1dceb3e","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/6fdfacf7-a963-47ff-b312-01b0e1dceb3e/application","descriptionHtml":"<h1><strong>Terac: The Expert Network Powering Frontier Research</strong></h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>About the role:</strong></h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for a founding operator to partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the company’s core functions. You will work on the highest-priority problems in the company including managing key customer relationships, building out the founding team, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h1><strong>You will:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinate the delivery of our highest-value projects</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with the CEO to drive important business decisions</p></li></ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure execution under demanding timelines</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>You have/are:</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Background in consulting, finance, startups, or other operationally intense environments.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical and communication abilities; proven track record of managing complex projects.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excited by “gritty” process optimization and large-scale execution.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Misc</strong></h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We operate six days per week.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Terac culture: </strong>Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"TERAC: THE EXPERT NETWORK POWERING FRONTIER RESEARCH\n\nTerac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the worlds most innovative organizations.\n\nWe work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE:\n\nWe're looking for a founding operator to partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the company’s core functions. You will work on the highest-priority problems in the company including managing key customer relationships, building out the founding team, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nYou're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.\n\n\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Coordinate the delivery of our highest-value projects\n\n - Work with the CEO to drive important business decisions\n\n - Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform\n\n - Ensure execution under demanding timelines\n\n - Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency.\n   \n   \n\n\nYOU HAVE/ARE:\n\n - Background in consulting, finance, startups, or other operationally intense environments.\n\n - Strong analytical and communication abilities; proven track record of managing complex projects.\n\n - Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.\n\n - Excited by “gritty” process optimization and large-scale execution.\n   \n   \n\n\nMISC\n\n - We operate six days per week.\n\n - Terac culture: Between weekly presentations, company hackathons, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$30K – $55K • Offers Bonus","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":"$30K - $55K","compensationTiers":[{"id":"7e208324-71a1-45df-ba11-ee70f98f9906","tierSummary":"$30K – $55K • Offers Bonus","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"8f1453f5-ec49-4a89-9796-4ff6eac55569","summary":"Offers Bonus","compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"628a6b95-1663-44d9-a2c7-1a47255cd92c","summary":"$30K – $55K","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":30000,"maxValue":55000}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":30000,"maxValue":55000}]}},{"id":"8354a7c2-b16c-4f47-a00e-8d4a3b4433e4","title":"STEM PhDs and Postdocs: Problem Creation for AI Reasoning","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"India","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-13T17:06:25.544+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"India"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/8354a7c2-b16c-4f47-a00e-8d4a3b4433e4","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/8354a7c2-b16c-4f47-a00e-8d4a3b4433e4/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're hiring advanced STEM experts to help improve the scientific reasoning capabilities of sophisticated AI models. This ongoing project focuses on generating high-quality training data that requires deep academic expertise to construct and verify. Your work directly contributes to expanding how accurately these systems process complex scientific and mathematical queries.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participants will work remotely to create original graduate-to-PhD-level problems within their specific academic domains. You will write a rigorous step-by-step solution for each problem and provide a single verifiable answer. The workflow also involves reviewing AI-generated responses to pinpoint specific reasoning errors or factual inaccuracies. All tasks are completed asynchronously through our online platform following an initial project assessment.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This opportunity is designed for individuals with deep subject-matter knowledge, strong analytical reasoning, and careful technical writing skills. We welcome PhD candidates, postdoctoral researchers, faculty members, and advanced STEM practitioners. Relevant backgrounds include biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, and complex engineering disciplines.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Create original graduate-level academic problems in your specific area of expertise.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Write rigorous, step-by-step solutions that lead to a single verifiable answer.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review AI-generated scientific responses to identify logical and factual errors.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Apply careful technical writing skills to ensure absolute clarity and precision.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Current PhD candidate, postdoctoral researcher, faculty member, or advanced STEM expert</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep subject-matter expertise in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience teaching, reviewing, or developing advanced academic problems</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical reasoning and technical writing capabilities</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Willingness to complete identity verification and an initial skills assessment</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$112 per task</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/9ad13b5b-192b-4a6b-80d0-077bfabf41a0?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're hiring advanced STEM experts to help improve the scientific reasoning capabilities of sophisticated AI models. This ongoing project focuses on generating high-quality training data that requires deep academic expertise to construct and verify. Your work directly contributes to expanding how accurately these systems process complex scientific and mathematical queries.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nParticipants will work remotely to create original graduate-to-PhD-level problems within their specific academic domains. You will write a rigorous step-by-step solution for each problem and provide a single verifiable answer. The workflow also involves reviewing AI-generated responses to pinpoint specific reasoning errors or factual inaccuracies. All tasks are completed asynchronously through our online platform following an initial project assessment.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nThis opportunity is designed for individuals with deep subject-matter knowledge, strong analytical reasoning, and careful technical writing skills. We welcome PhD candidates, postdoctoral researchers, faculty members, and advanced STEM practitioners. Relevant backgrounds include biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, and complex engineering disciplines.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Create original graduate-level academic problems in your specific area of expertise.\n\n - Write rigorous, step-by-step solutions that lead to a single verifiable answer.\n\n - Review AI-generated scientific responses to identify logical and factual errors.\n\n - Apply careful technical writing skills to ensure absolute clarity and precision.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Current PhD candidate, postdoctoral researcher, faculty member, or advanced STEM expert\n\n - Deep subject-matter expertise in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering\n\n - Experience teaching, reviewing, or developing advanced academic problems\n\n - Strong analytical reasoning and technical writing capabilities\n\n - Willingness to complete identity verification and an initial skills assessment\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$112 per task\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/9ad13b5b-192b-4a6b-80d0-077bfabf41a0?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"3a73c16c-c0db-4b35-80d2-6bf4cd3a6344","title":"Strategic Projects Lead","department":"Operations","team":"Operations","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"San Francisco","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-05-01T02:39:10.728+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":false,"workplaceType":"OnSite","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"California","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"San Francisco"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/3a73c16c-c0db-4b35-80d2-6bf4cd3a6344","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/3a73c16c-c0db-4b35-80d2-6bf4cd3a6344/application","descriptionHtml":"<h1>Terac: The Expert Network Powering Frontier Research</h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the world's most innovative organizations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.</p><h1>About the role:</h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for a strategic project lead to partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the company’s core function: recruiting. You will work with our largest customers to understand and solve their needs.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.</p><h1>You will:</h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinate the delivery of our highest-value projects to customers worth millions of dollars.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with the CEO to drive important business decisions</p></li></ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure execution under demanding timelines</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency.</p></li></ul><h1>You have/are:</h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Background in consulting, finance, startups, or other operationally intense environments.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical and communication abilities; proven track record of managing complex projects.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excited by “gritty” process optimization and large-scale execution.</p></li></ul><h1>Misc</h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Compensation: Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac culture: Between company hackathons, weekly presentations on the latest advancements, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"TERAC: THE EXPERT NETWORK POWERING FRONTIER RESEARCH\n\nTerac helps teams reach faster research breakthroughs through our marketplace of verified experts. We are building agents to recruit, verify, and match 10,000s experts with 1000s of opportunities from the world's most innovative organizations.\n\nWe work with leading enterprises and are backed by top investors.\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE:\n\nWe're looking for a strategic project lead to partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the company’s core function: recruiting. You will work with our largest customers to understand and solve their needs.\n\nYou're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Coordinate the delivery of our highest-value projects to customers worth millions of dollars.\n\n - Work with the CEO to drive important business decisions\n\n - Oversee and orchestrate the work of 10,000s of experts on our platform\n\n - Ensure execution under demanding timelines\n\n - Diagnose bottlenecks, restructure workflows, and implement solutions that improve quality, throughput, and cost-efficiency.\n\n\nYOU HAVE/ARE:\n\n - Background in consulting, finance, startups, or other operationally intense environments.\n\n - Strong analytical and communication abilities; proven track record of managing complex projects.\n\n - Comfortable working directly with high-profile clients.\n\n - Excited by “gritty” process optimization and large-scale execution.\n\n\nMISC\n\n - Compensation: Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match\n\n - Terac culture: Between company hackathons, weekly presentations on the latest advancements, and an AI-first mindset, you'll be working with one of the most innovative teams on the planet.\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$120K – $160K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":"$120K - $160K","compensationTiers":[{"id":"d3643d32-b7fe-4b2a-a758-afcb6bfeaf17","tierSummary":"$120K – $160K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"ad33ad0d-8d93-4e73-871a-bf5c63012ae4","summary":"$120K – $160K","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":120000,"maxValue":160000},{"id":"92c06767-018a-4efb-870d-af8d5cc25548","summary":"Offers Equity","compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"id":"0bc137b6-a35e-4365-923c-8100a7e72e48","summary":"Offers Bonus","compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":120000,"maxValue":160000},{"compensationType":"EquityPercentage","interval":"NONE","currencyCode":null,"minValue":null,"maxValue":null},{"compensationType":"Bonus","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":null,"maxValue":null}]}},{"id":"b7732bd7-0046-4a98-b6ed-2dac344b51f8","title":"Professionals: Designing Challenging AI Prompts","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-25T19:14:05.738+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/b7732bd7-0046-4a98-b6ed-2dac344b51f8","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/b7732bd7-0046-4a98-b6ed-2dac344b51f8/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study to build a bench of people who are exceptionally good at designing tasks that expose AI model limitations. By turning real-world workflows into demanding requests, we can better evaluate where current models break down. This initial trial helps us identify individuals suited for ongoing prompt engineering and evaluation work.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will spend about an hour translating a complex workflow from your job or personal life into a demanding prompt that requires reasoning and real-world lookup. After running it in ChatGPT to identify where the model fails, you will refine the prompt until it breaks the system. Finally, you will write a clear grading rubric that a stranger could use to evaluate any AI's attempt at your task. This entire process is screen-recorded, as we are assessing your thought process just as much as the final submitted files.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome professionals, domain experts, and power users who have deep knowledge of specific workflows. You need to be capable of evaluating an AI's output within seconds and comfortable working on a laptop or desktop with a ChatGPT account. Candidates who excel at this trial will be considered for a long-term bench of evaluators.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Pick a familiar workflow and convert it into a demanding AI prompt</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Test your prompt in ChatGPT to find failure points, making it harder if the AI succeeds</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Write a comprehensive rubric for grading the AI's performance</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Share your screen, camera, and microphone while completing the task</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Submit your prompt, failure notes, rubric, and the generated output file</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep familiarity with a specific professional or personal workflow</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to quickly evaluate the accuracy and quality of AI outputs</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to a laptop or desktop computer</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">An active ChatGPT account</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable being screen-recorded while thinking through complex tasks</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$20 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/bac94240-9ba4-477a-bb8d-9b3b2af686d2?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study to build a bench of people who are exceptionally good at designing tasks that expose AI model limitations. By turning real-world workflows into demanding requests, we can better evaluate where current models break down. This initial trial helps us identify individuals suited for ongoing prompt engineering and evaluation work.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will spend about an hour translating a complex workflow from your job or personal life into a demanding prompt that requires reasoning and real-world lookup. After running it in ChatGPT to identify where the model fails, you will refine the prompt until it breaks the system. Finally, you will write a clear grading rubric that a stranger could use to evaluate any AI's attempt at your task. This entire process is screen-recorded, as we are assessing your thought process just as much as the final submitted files.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe welcome professionals, domain experts, and power users who have deep knowledge of specific workflows. You need to be capable of evaluating an AI's output within seconds and comfortable working on a laptop or desktop with a ChatGPT account. Candidates who excel at this trial will be considered for a long-term bench of evaluators.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Pick a familiar workflow and convert it into a demanding AI prompt\n\n - Test your prompt in ChatGPT to find failure points, making it harder if the AI succeeds\n\n - Write a comprehensive rubric for grading the AI's performance\n\n - Share your screen, camera, and microphone while completing the task\n\n - Submit your prompt, failure notes, rubric, and the generated output file\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Deep familiarity with a specific professional or personal workflow\n\n - Ability to quickly evaluate the accuracy and quality of AI outputs\n\n - Access to a laptop or desktop computer\n\n - An active ChatGPT account\n\n - Comfortable being screen-recorded while thinking through complex tasks\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$20 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/bac94240-9ba4-477a-bb8d-9b3b2af686d2?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"1a9a56a5-f65d-47d1-812c-b84864ca15ae","title":"We'd like to learn more about how you make decisions regarding the solutions you use at your company!","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:14:59.923+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/1a9a56a5-f65d-47d1-812c-b84864ca15ae","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/1a9a56a5-f65d-47d1-812c-b84864ca15ae/application","descriptionHtml":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Share Your Everyday Experiences with Us! This research opportunity is designed to gather a wide range of perspectives on general topics. Your unique insights are crucial in helping us understand how people interact with various products and services, ultimately contributing to better, more intuitive solutions.During this 15-minute remote session, you will engage in a series of questions and complete a simple, interactive task. We encourage you to share your thoughts, feelings, and experiences openly. This is an excellent chance to make your voice heard and influence future developments.We are looking for honest, candid feedback that reflects your genuine interactions and opinions. Your participation will provide valuable data that informs decision-making and helps shape user-centered designs. This remote opportunity requires participation from your personal computer. During the session, you'll be guided through a task that involves sharing your view and activity on screen, and your input will be recorded to capture your valuable non-verbal reactions and expressions.</p><h2>Responsibilities</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Engage with a series of guided questions</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete a brief, interactive task</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Articulate your thoughts and feelings openly</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide honest and constructive feedback on your experience</p></li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Individuals eager to share their diverse perspectives</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">People comfortable communicating their opinions</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Those interested in contributing to product and service development</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">USD 10.50-15.00 for the interview</p><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/639122a3-0ef5-4d1a-af9e-ff2bbffe200c?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p>","descriptionPlain":"Share Your Everyday Experiences with Us! This research opportunity is designed to gather a wide range of perspectives on general topics. Your unique insights are crucial in helping us understand how people interact with various products and services, ultimately contributing to better, more intuitive solutions.During this 15-minute remote session, you will engage in a series of questions and complete a simple, interactive task. We encourage you to share your thoughts, feelings, and experiences openly. This is an excellent chance to make your voice heard and influence future developments.We are looking for honest, candid feedback that reflects your genuine interactions and opinions. Your participation will provide valuable data that informs decision-making and helps shape user-centered designs. This remote opportunity requires participation from your personal computer. During the session, you'll be guided through a task that involves sharing your view and activity on screen, and your input will be recorded to capture your valuable non-verbal reactions and expressions.\n\n\nRESPONSIBILITIES\n\n - Engage with a series of guided questions\n\n - Complete a brief, interactive task\n\n - Articulate your thoughts and feelings openly\n\n - Provide honest and constructive feedback on your experience\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n\n - Individuals eager to share their diverse perspectives\n\n - People comfortable communicating their opinions\n\n - Those interested in contributing to product and service development\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\nUSD 10.50-15.00 for the interview\n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/639122a3-0ef5-4d1a-af9e-ff2bbffe200c?utm_source=ashby_listing_description","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"3a28dd52-ced4-4aa9-8243-184d3f413a3f","title":"TEMPLATE","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-06-22T18:25:51.572+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/3a28dd52-ced4-4aa9-8243-184d3f413a3f","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/3a28dd52-ced4-4aa9-8243-184d3f413a3f/application","descriptionHtml":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">EXAMPLE</p>","descriptionPlain":"EXAMPLE","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"7f03944b-faf5-4829-b40c-2f9edf2fe0ec","title":"AI Evaluators: Assessing A Shopping Assistant","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-09-02T00:00:57.467+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/7f03944b-faf5-4829-b40c-2f9edf2fe0ec","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/7f03944b-faf5-4829-b40c-2f9edf2fe0ec/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're hiring AI evaluators to assess the accuracy and helpfulness of a new digital shopping assistant. This project focuses on understanding how well the system handles real-world e-commerce queries and where it falls short in its logic. Your analysis will directly feed into improving the underlying model and its response quality.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will review real interaction traces between users and the shopping assistant within our custom platform. As you analyze these conversations, you will pinpoint specific failures, logical errors, or unhelpful product recommendations. From there, you will create structured rubrics and verifiers to consistently judge future response quality. This is an ongoing remote engagement requiring 20+ hours per week.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This opportunity is ideal for quality assurance specialists, AI data evaluators, and e-commerce professionals with a strong eye for detail. We welcome applicants with prior experience in prompt engineering, complex data annotation, or software testing. You should be comfortable analyzing text interactions deeply and building structured evaluation frameworks from scratch.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review real user interaction traces with an AI shopping assistant</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify logical failures, inaccuracies, or poor recommendations in the text</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Create structured rubrics and verifiers to judge response quality</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Commit to 20+ hours per week of evaluation work on our internal platform</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in data evaluation, quality assurance, or AI training</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical skills with the ability to spot subtle errors in text</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with e-commerce search and digital shopping experiences</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to commit to a sustained workload of 20+ hours per week</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$50 per hour</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/c5aab5ae-fa85-45ab-918d-a8b7cdf9f0ec?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're hiring AI evaluators to assess the accuracy and helpfulness of a new digital shopping assistant. This project focuses on understanding how well the system handles real-world e-commerce queries and where it falls short in its logic. Your analysis will directly feed into improving the underlying model and its response quality.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will review real interaction traces between users and the shopping assistant within our custom platform. As you analyze these conversations, you will pinpoint specific failures, logical errors, or unhelpful product recommendations. From there, you will create structured rubrics and verifiers to consistently judge future response quality. This is an ongoing remote engagement requiring 20+ hours per week.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nThis opportunity is ideal for quality assurance specialists, AI data evaluators, and e-commerce professionals with a strong eye for detail. We welcome applicants with prior experience in prompt engineering, complex data annotation, or software testing. You should be comfortable analyzing text interactions deeply and building structured evaluation frameworks from scratch.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Review real user interaction traces with an AI shopping assistant\n\n - Identify logical failures, inaccuracies, or poor recommendations in the text\n\n - Create structured rubrics and verifiers to judge response quality\n\n - Commit to 20+ hours per week of evaluation work on our internal platform\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Experience in data evaluation, quality assurance, or AI training\n\n - Strong analytical skills with the ability to spot subtle errors in text\n\n - Familiarity with e-commerce search and digital shopping experiences\n\n - Ability to commit to a sustained workload of 20+ hours per week\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$50 per hour\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/c5aab5ae-fa85-45ab-918d-a8b7cdf9f0ec?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"b101bb03-ac9e-4997-9b67-232fc928fe08","title":"Engagement Manager","department":"GTM","team":"GTM","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"San Francisco","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-06-30T13:25:29.039+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":false,"workplaceType":"OnSite","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"California","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"San Francisco"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/b101bb03-ac9e-4997-9b67-232fc928fe08","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/b101bb03-ac9e-4997-9b67-232fc928fe08/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2><strong>About Terac</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the infrastructure for accessing human capability on demand. We are working toward a future where Terac deeply understands:</p><ol style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What every person is capable of, what they want, and where they can thrive</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What work our customers need completed and what success requires</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What creates a great match between the two</p></li></ol><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">With this understanding, Terac can intelligently allocate human capability to the work where it creates the most value for both our experts and customers. Today, our initial wedge is providing specialized experts for AI training, evaluation, market research, and other expert-driven research.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This future was not previously possible. Understanding people and work at this depth required more information and judgment than any organization could reasonably process. As a result, the labor market came to rely on crude proxies: résumés, credentials, applications, interviews, and personal networks. At Terac, we're changing this by making it possible to synthesize thousands of signals about a person’s knowledge, performance, preferences, and potential while developing an equally detailed understanding of the work itself.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We place 1,000s of experts per month, pay our experts, on average, over $90/hr. We're a team of 15 based in San Francisco, and we work with many leading research companies.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As an Engagement Manager, you will own key customer relationships across application-layer companies, research labs, and enterprise clients, serving as the primary point of contact from evaluation through delivery. You’ll partner closely with technical and business stakeholders to guide training and deployment, resolve issues, and ensure a high-quality customer experience.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You’ll work cross-functionally with product, operations, and engineering to manage timelines, support execution, and surface insights that drive account growth. This role also plays a key part in expanding revenue where you will lead commercial processes for new and existing customers and helping leadership identify and unblock growth opportunities in a fast-moving AI environment.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>You will:</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own a robust independent client book with full revenue ownership, identifying upselling and cross selling opportunities in existing relationships</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bring in new customers, labs, and enterprises to Terac</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work closely with customer C-levels on strategic cross-agency initiatives</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Forecast revenue growth and help leadership understand how to unblock additional growth opportunities</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Act as the quarterback of the agency account by leveraging cross-functional relationships with Terac teams to bring the best of Terac to our clients</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide unique value to our agency partners through trainings, co-hosted events, eng support, and whatever else they need to succeed</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>You have:</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in a technical partnership or sales role</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A proven track record in enterprise client facing roles and expanding customer relationships</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent verbal and written communications</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience at a fast-growth tech startup or top-tier consulting/finance firm</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Great cross-functional experience and collaborative ability</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h2>Misc Details</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Compensation: </strong>Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We operate in-person six days per week in our downtown SF office</p></li></ul>","descriptionPlain":"ABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the infrastructure for accessing human capability on demand. We are working toward a future where Terac deeply understands:\n\n 1. What every person is capable of, what they want, and where they can thrive\n\n 2. What work our customers need completed and what success requires\n\n 3. What creates a great match between the two\n\nWith this understanding, Terac can intelligently allocate human capability to the work where it creates the most value for both our experts and customers. Today, our initial wedge is providing specialized experts for AI training, evaluation, market research, and other expert-driven research.\n\nThis future was not previously possible. Understanding people and work at this depth required more information and judgment than any organization could reasonably process. As a result, the labor market came to rely on crude proxies: résumés, credentials, applications, interviews, and personal networks. At Terac, we're changing this by making it possible to synthesize thousands of signals about a person’s knowledge, performance, preferences, and potential while developing an equally detailed understanding of the work itself.\n\nWe place 1,000s of experts per month, pay our experts, on average, over $90/hr. We're a team of 15 based in San Francisco, and we work with many leading research companies.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nAs an Engagement Manager, you will own key customer relationships across application-layer companies, research labs, and enterprise clients, serving as the primary point of contact from evaluation through delivery. You’ll partner closely with technical and business stakeholders to guide training and deployment, resolve issues, and ensure a high-quality customer experience.\n\nYou’ll work cross-functionally with product, operations, and engineering to manage timelines, support execution, and surface insights that drive account growth. This role also plays a key part in expanding revenue where you will lead commercial processes for new and existing customers and helping leadership identify and unblock growth opportunities in a fast-moving AI environment.\n\n\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Own a robust independent client book with full revenue ownership, identifying upselling and cross selling opportunities in existing relationships\n\n - Bring in new customers, labs, and enterprises to Terac\n\n - Work closely with customer C-levels on strategic cross-agency initiatives\n\n - Forecast revenue growth and help leadership understand how to unblock additional growth opportunities\n\n - Act as the quarterback of the agency account by leveraging cross-functional relationships with Terac teams to bring the best of Terac to our clients\n\n - Provide unique value to our agency partners through trainings, co-hosted events, eng support, and whatever else they need to succeed\n\n\n\n\nYOU HAVE:\n\n - Experience in a technical partnership or sales role\n\n - A proven track record in enterprise client facing roles and expanding customer relationships\n\n - Excellent verbal and written communications\n\n - Experience at a fast-growth tech startup or top-tier consulting/finance firm\n\n - Great cross-functional experience and collaborative ability\n   \n   \n\n\nMISC DETAILS\n\n - Compensation: Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.\n\n - We operate in-person six days per week in our downtown SF office","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"8f08b4e6-bc23-4f62-8e70-5055aa3f13c1","title":"CVS Health Professionals: Interview On Organizational Workflows","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-07T18:34:21.148+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/8f08b4e6-bc23-4f62-8e70-5055aa3f13c1","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/8f08b4e6-bc23-4f62-8e70-5055aa3f13c1/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on the operational workflows and internal dynamics of large healthcare enterprises. Our goal is to understand how different business units collaborate and manage their daily responsibilities. This feedback directly informs our perspective on modern healthcare administration and corporate structure.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will join a remote, AI-moderated interview to discuss your current role and daily activities. We will ask you to walk through your typical tasks, team structures, and the tools you use most frequently. You will also react to specific scenarios related to cross-departmental collaboration and workflow efficiency. The entire conversation takes place via a standard voice and video call.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for active professionals working within the CVS Health enterprise. We welcome current staff from Aetna, CVS Caremark, CVS Health Corporate, and CVS Health Services. Candidates should be comfortable discussing their day-to-day administrative or operational routines.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk us through your typical daily workflows and primary responsibilities</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Describe how your specific division interacts with other business units</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Detail the primary tools and operational processes you rely on</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">React to questions about organizational efficiency and communication</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Currently employed within the CVS Health ecosystem</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiar with internal workflows and daily operational routines</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable discussing high-level team structures and collaboration</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Available for a remote video interview</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$50 one-time</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/b30d9beb-545b-4bf0-91ac-df5ce8bbe86f?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on the operational workflows and internal dynamics of large healthcare enterprises. Our goal is to understand how different business units collaborate and manage their daily responsibilities. This feedback directly informs our perspective on modern healthcare administration and corporate structure.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will join a remote, AI-moderated interview to discuss your current role and daily activities. We will ask you to walk through your typical tasks, team structures, and the tools you use most frequently. You will also react to specific scenarios related to cross-departmental collaboration and workflow efficiency. The entire conversation takes place via a standard voice and video call.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are looking for active professionals working within the CVS Health enterprise. We welcome current staff from Aetna, CVS Caremark, CVS Health Corporate, and CVS Health Services. Candidates should be comfortable discussing their day-to-day administrative or operational routines.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Walk us through your typical daily workflows and primary responsibilities\n\n - Describe how your specific division interacts with other business units\n\n - Detail the primary tools and operational processes you rely on\n\n - React to questions about organizational efficiency and communication\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Currently employed within the CVS Health ecosystem\n\n - Familiar with internal workflows and daily operational routines\n\n - Comfortable discussing high-level team structures and collaboration\n\n - Available for a remote video interview\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$50 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/b30d9beb-545b-4bf0-91ac-df5ce8bbe86f?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"f1ce191b-3886-4fcc-845b-1248e4c712c4","title":"Mechanical Engineers (Automotive and Aerospace): Paid Study on Change Workflows","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-17T01:43:20.401+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/f1ce191b-3886-4fcc-845b-1248e4c712c4","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/f1ce191b-3886-4fcc-845b-1248e4c712c4/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're hiring Mechanical Engineering SMEs to help us evaluate standard engineering change workflows. This paid study focuses on how complex CAD models are managed and updated within professional automotive and aerospace environments. Your input will feed directly into improving tools for managing engineering documentation and version control.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will participate in a remote session to walk us through your typical engineering change processes. During the study, you will deliver realistic CAD models using tools like SolidWorks or FreeCAD. You will then document the steps required to implement and approve a design change within those models. Finally, you will answer a series of questions about the friction points in your current workflow.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome mechanical engineers with professional design experience in the automotive or aerospace sectors. Ideal candidates have hands-on expertise with industry-standard CAD software, including SolidWorks and FreeCAD. We are specifically looking for professionals who actively manage engineering change documentation as part of their day-to-day role.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deliver realistic CAD models using SolidWorks, FreeCAD, or similar tools.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk us through your standard engineering change workflows.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Document the steps taken to update and approve design modifications.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide feedback on current challenges in version control and documentation.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Professional mechanical engineering experience</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Background in automotive or aerospace design environments</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on proficiency with SolidWorks or FreeCAD</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with standard engineering change order processes</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$100 per hour</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/4472b347-ef6e-406b-867a-8f2d50331235?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're hiring Mechanical Engineering SMEs to help us evaluate standard engineering change workflows. This paid study focuses on how complex CAD models are managed and updated within professional automotive and aerospace environments. Your input will feed directly into improving tools for managing engineering documentation and version control.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will participate in a remote session to walk us through your typical engineering change processes. During the study, you will deliver realistic CAD models using tools like SolidWorks or FreeCAD. You will then document the steps required to implement and approve a design change within those models. Finally, you will answer a series of questions about the friction points in your current workflow.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe welcome mechanical engineers with professional design experience in the automotive or aerospace sectors. Ideal candidates have hands-on expertise with industry-standard CAD software, including SolidWorks and FreeCAD. We are specifically looking for professionals who actively manage engineering change documentation as part of their day-to-day role.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Deliver realistic CAD models using SolidWorks, FreeCAD, or similar tools.\n\n - Walk us through your standard engineering change workflows.\n\n - Document the steps taken to update and approve design modifications.\n\n - Provide feedback on current challenges in version control and documentation.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Professional mechanical engineering experience\n\n - Background in automotive or aerospace design environments\n\n - Hands-on proficiency with SolidWorks or FreeCAD\n\n - Familiarity with standard engineering change order processes\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$100 per hour\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/4472b347-ef6e-406b-867a-8f2d50331235?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"ce8f2b57-6455-44cd-b593-258f39c96419","title":"TEMPLATE","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-07T21:15:08.224+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/ce8f2b57-6455-44cd-b593-258f39c96419","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/ce8f2b57-6455-44cd-b593-258f39c96419/application","descriptionHtml":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">EXAMPLE</p>","descriptionPlain":"EXAMPLE","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"9f04f139-680a-4971-a606-eaa8f3be6ad3","title":"Marketing Professionals: 30-Minute Interview on Industry Experience","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-22T18:40:46.292+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/9f04f139-680a-4971-a606-eaa8f3be6ad3","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/9f04f139-680a-4971-a606-eaa8f3be6ad3/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on the daily workflows and strategic decisions of marketing professionals. This research helps us understand the current landscape of campaign management and audience engagement. Your insights will inform a broader look at how modern marketing teams operate and measure success.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will start by completing a short qualification check to confirm your professional background. Once verified, you will join a 30-minute AI-moderated interview from your computer or mobile device. During this session, you will be asked to walk through your recent marketing experiences and strategy planning. You will answer questions at your own pace and explain the reasoning behind your professional choices.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome marketing professionals, campaign managers, digital strategists, and growth marketers. You should have hands-on experience running recent marketing campaigns or managing brand strategies. Candidates from both agency and in-house roles are encouraged to apply.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete a brief qualification check to verify your marketing background</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participate in a 30-minute AI-moderated interview</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk us through your recent marketing campaigns and daily workflows</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Describe how you measure success and approach strategic planning</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Active professional in the marketing industry</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on experience managing or contributing to marketing campaigns</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable discussing your strategy and workflow decisions</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to a computer or mobile device for a remote interview</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$75 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/f233da24-98d3-4628-b383-c42741e096a8?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on the daily workflows and strategic decisions of marketing professionals. This research helps us understand the current landscape of campaign management and audience engagement. Your insights will inform a broader look at how modern marketing teams operate and measure success.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will start by completing a short qualification check to confirm your professional background. Once verified, you will join a 30-minute AI-moderated interview from your computer or mobile device. During this session, you will be asked to walk through your recent marketing experiences and strategy planning. You will answer questions at your own pace and explain the reasoning behind your professional choices.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe welcome marketing professionals, campaign managers, digital strategists, and growth marketers. You should have hands-on experience running recent marketing campaigns or managing brand strategies. Candidates from both agency and in-house roles are encouraged to apply.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Complete a brief qualification check to verify your marketing background\n\n - Participate in a 30-minute AI-moderated interview\n\n - Walk us through your recent marketing campaigns and daily workflows\n\n - Describe how you measure success and approach strategic planning\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Active professional in the marketing industry\n\n - Hands-on experience managing or contributing to marketing campaigns\n\n - Comfortable discussing your strategy and workflow decisions\n\n - Access to a computer or mobile device for a remote interview\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$75 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/f233da24-98d3-4628-b383-c42741e096a8?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"957f0e42-2390-4522-94ae-b1fe7f6b35db","title":"Experienced Designers: Design Judgment For AI Research","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-25T22:11:15.755+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/957f0e42-2390-4522-94ae-b1fe7f6b35db","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/957f0e42-2390-4522-94ae-b1fe7f6b35db/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on how expert designers evaluate and critique creative work. The goal is to translate intuitive design judgment into structured tasks and clear evaluation rubrics. This work directly supports the development of AI models that can better understand and analyze visual design.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will participate in a remote session to review various design artifacts and provide structured feedback. We will ask you to break down your creative decision-making process and explain how you evaluate quality. You will then help us draft evaluation rubrics based on those expert critiques. The session involves screen-sharing and walking us through your analytical workflow.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are hiring experienced designers and creative professionals with a strong background in visual critique. We welcome UX/UI designers, graphic designers, art directors, and creative leads. Candidates should have a proven track record of evaluating creative work and building design systems or guidelines.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review and critique various visual design artifacts</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Break down intuitive design judgment into structured, repeatable tasks</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Draft clear evaluation rubrics for assessing design quality</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk us through your creative decision-making process during a remote call</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Professional experience as a designer, art director, or creative lead</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong background in providing visual critique and actionable design feedback</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable articulating the reasoning behind creative decisions</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to translate subjective design quality into objective rubrics</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$30 per hour</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/7e96ea5c-ffb6-48b5-a24f-3332908977a6?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on how expert designers evaluate and critique creative work. The goal is to translate intuitive design judgment into structured tasks and clear evaluation rubrics. This work directly supports the development of AI models that can better understand and analyze visual design.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will participate in a remote session to review various design artifacts and provide structured feedback. We will ask you to break down your creative decision-making process and explain how you evaluate quality. You will then help us draft evaluation rubrics based on those expert critiques. The session involves screen-sharing and walking us through your analytical workflow.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are hiring experienced designers and creative professionals with a strong background in visual critique. We welcome UX/UI designers, graphic designers, art directors, and creative leads. Candidates should have a proven track record of evaluating creative work and building design systems or guidelines.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Review and critique various visual design artifacts\n\n - Break down intuitive design judgment into structured, repeatable tasks\n\n - Draft clear evaluation rubrics for assessing design quality\n\n - Walk us through your creative decision-making process during a remote call\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Professional experience as a designer, art director, or creative lead\n\n - Strong background in providing visual critique and actionable design feedback\n\n - Comfortable articulating the reasoning behind creative decisions\n\n - Ability to translate subjective design quality into objective rubrics\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$30 per hour\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/7e96ea5c-ffb6-48b5-a24f-3332908977a6?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"83c6d1d7-bac5-4fec-9692-7eff7ddf767c","title":"Strategic Operations Professionals: Task Evaluation and Scoring","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-31T18:18:24.349+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/83c6d1d7-bac5-4fec-9692-7eff7ddf767c","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/83c6d1d7-bac5-4fec-9692-7eff7ddf767c/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on how expert operational decision-making can be quantified and structured for artificial intelligence systems. The goal is to better understand how complex human judgments are translated into clear criteria and scoring rubrics. This work directly supports the ongoing improvement of advanced data models.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will participate in a remote session to review various operational scenarios and workflows. During the process, you will be asked to define structured tasks and establish clear evaluation criteria based on your professional experience. We will have you build scoring rubrics that capture the nuances of high-level strategic operations. The session involves focused, independent work alongside guided prompts to capture your logic step by step.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome operations managers, strategic project leaders, and human-data professionals with deep experience in complex decision-making. You should be highly comfortable taking ambiguous business processes and breaking them down into measurable frameworks. Professionals who regularly design operational metrics or evaluation standards will be an especially strong fit.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review complex operational workflows and strategic business scenarios</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Translate high-level judgments into structured tasks and clear evaluation criteria</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design scoring rubrics that accurately measure performance or quality</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Explain the reasoning behind your chosen metrics and operational frameworks</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Professional background in strategic projects, operations, or human-data workflows</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience designing evaluation criteria, rubrics, or operational metrics</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable breaking down complex, ambiguous workflows into structured steps</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong ability to articulate the logic behind operational decisions</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$40 per hour</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/765f0a30-2af9-462c-9316-c12e48729993?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on how expert operational decision-making can be quantified and structured for artificial intelligence systems. The goal is to better understand how complex human judgments are translated into clear criteria and scoring rubrics. This work directly supports the ongoing improvement of advanced data models.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will participate in a remote session to review various operational scenarios and workflows. During the process, you will be asked to define structured tasks and establish clear evaluation criteria based on your professional experience. We will have you build scoring rubrics that capture the nuances of high-level strategic operations. The session involves focused, independent work alongside guided prompts to capture your logic step by step.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe welcome operations managers, strategic project leaders, and human-data professionals with deep experience in complex decision-making. You should be highly comfortable taking ambiguous business processes and breaking them down into measurable frameworks. Professionals who regularly design operational metrics or evaluation standards will be an especially strong fit.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Review complex operational workflows and strategic business scenarios\n\n - Translate high-level judgments into structured tasks and clear evaluation criteria\n\n - Design scoring rubrics that accurately measure performance or quality\n\n - Explain the reasoning behind your chosen metrics and operational frameworks\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Professional background in strategic projects, operations, or human-data workflows\n\n - Experience designing evaluation criteria, rubrics, or operational metrics\n\n - Comfortable breaking down complex, ambiguous workflows into structured steps\n\n - Strong ability to articulate the logic behind operational decisions\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$40 per hour\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/765f0a30-2af9-462c-9316-c12e48729993?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"c3571fb3-f7c7-492b-95c4-cb086e30f142","title":"Marketing Professionals: 30-Minute Interview On Industry Experience","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"Poland","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-22T19:39:52.403+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"Poland"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/c3571fb3-f7c7-492b-95c4-cb086e30f142","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/c3571fb3-f7c7-492b-95c4-cb086e30f142/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on the day-to-day workflows and strategies of modern marketing professionals. Help us evaluate how different marketing campaigns are planned, executed, and measured across various channels. This research aims to identify common challenges and successful tactics used by industry practitioners.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will start by completing a short qualification check to confirm your background. After qualifying, you will participate in a 30-minute AI-moderated interview from your desktop or mobile device. During the session, you will answer a series of spoken questions about your recent marketing campaigns and professional experience. You will be asked to walk through your decision-making process and how you measure success.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for marketing professionals with hands-on experience in campaign management and strategy. We welcome digital marketers, brand managers, growth specialists, and marketing coordinators. Candidates should be comfortable discussing their daily tasks and the tools they use to achieve their goals.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete a brief initial qualification check</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participate in a 30-minute AI-moderated interview</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Describe recent marketing campaigns you have managed or contributed to</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk us through how you measure and report on campaign success</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Current or recent experience in a professional marketing role</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable speaking clearly about your marketing strategies and workflows</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to a quiet environment with a stable internet connection</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Willingness to interact with an AI moderator for the interview portion</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$105 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/f678dcd5-5123-4d39-a9ea-a3053386f554?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on the day-to-day workflows and strategies of modern marketing professionals. Help us evaluate how different marketing campaigns are planned, executed, and measured across various channels. This research aims to identify common challenges and successful tactics used by industry practitioners.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will start by completing a short qualification check to confirm your background. After qualifying, you will participate in a 30-minute AI-moderated interview from your desktop or mobile device. During the session, you will answer a series of spoken questions about your recent marketing campaigns and professional experience. You will be asked to walk through your decision-making process and how you measure success.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are looking for marketing professionals with hands-on experience in campaign management and strategy. We welcome digital marketers, brand managers, growth specialists, and marketing coordinators. Candidates should be comfortable discussing their daily tasks and the tools they use to achieve their goals.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Complete a brief initial qualification check\n\n - Participate in a 30-minute AI-moderated interview\n\n - Describe recent marketing campaigns you have managed or contributed to\n\n - Walk us through how you measure and report on campaign success\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Current or recent experience in a professional marketing role\n\n - Comfortable speaking clearly about your marketing strategies and workflows\n\n - Access to a quiet environment with a stable internet connection\n\n - Willingness to interact with an AI moderator for the interview portion\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$105 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/f678dcd5-5123-4d39-a9ea-a3053386f554?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"53618fba-f7bb-41a2-bc77-06e6a027ad4c","title":"CAD Engineers: Parametric Modeling and Modification Tasks","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-28T00:55:02.449+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/53618fba-f7bb-41a2-bc77-06e6a027ad4c","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/53618fba-f7bb-41a2-bc77-06e6a027ad4c/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on parametric design practices and mechanical engineering workflows.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This project focuses on how professional designers construct 3D assemblies and plan for future modifications.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Your contributions will help us evaluate industry-standard approaches to feature trees and design history management.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will be tasked with creating realistic parametric CAD models from scratch based on specific engineering requirements.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">After completing the initial geometry, you will document and execute a series of structural modification tasks on your own design.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">While you can draw on experience from various modeling environments, all final submissions must be delivered as native, editable SolidWorks files.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We expect you to maintain a clean feature tree that clearly demonstrates your design intent and revision history.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for mechanical engineers, product designers, and CAD specialists with strong 3D modeling fundamentals.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome professionals with backgrounds in SolidWorks, NX, Fusion 360, or other major parametric design software.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You must have the ability to generate clean, native SolidWorks files with an intact design history for your final deliverables.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Create complex parametric CAD models based on realistic engineering scenarios</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and execute structural modification tasks on your initial geometry</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintain a logical feature tree that preserves full design history</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Export and submit all final deliverables as native SolidWorks files</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Professional experience in mechanical engineering or industrial design</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong proficiency with 3D parametric modeling software (SolidWorks, NX, Fusion 360)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to produce native, fully editable SolidWorks assemblies</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable building models that anticipate future structural modifications</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$200 per task</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/b1bcd7b9-7774-4b0b-b9eb-b1b03fc70505?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on parametric design practices and mechanical engineering workflows.\n\nThis project focuses on how professional designers construct 3D assemblies and plan for future modifications.\n\nYour contributions will help us evaluate industry-standard approaches to feature trees and design history management.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will be tasked with creating realistic parametric CAD models from scratch based on specific engineering requirements.\n\nAfter completing the initial geometry, you will document and execute a series of structural modification tasks on your own design.\n\nWhile you can draw on experience from various modeling environments, all final submissions must be delivered as native, editable SolidWorks files.\n\nWe expect you to maintain a clean feature tree that clearly demonstrates your design intent and revision history.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are looking for mechanical engineers, product designers, and CAD specialists with strong 3D modeling fundamentals.\n\nWe welcome professionals with backgrounds in SolidWorks, NX, Fusion 360, or other major parametric design software.\n\nYou must have the ability to generate clean, native SolidWorks files with an intact design history for your final deliverables.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Create complex parametric CAD models based on realistic engineering scenarios\n\n - Design and execute structural modification tasks on your initial geometry\n\n - Maintain a logical feature tree that preserves full design history\n\n - Export and submit all final deliverables as native SolidWorks files\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Professional experience in mechanical engineering or industrial design\n\n - Strong proficiency with 3D parametric modeling software (SolidWorks, NX, Fusion 360)\n\n - Ability to produce native, fully editable SolidWorks assemblies\n\n - Comfortable building models that anticipate future structural modifications\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$200 per task\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/b1bcd7b9-7774-4b0b-b9eb-b1b03fc70505?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"bd9ec91a-1fb6-4073-8c53-70a61d6dbb96","title":"Brazilian Business Finance Leaders: Survey on Corporate Banking","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"Brazil","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-01T18:09:29.657+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"Brazil"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/bd9ec91a-1fb6-4073-8c53-70a61d6dbb96","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/bd9ec91a-1fb6-4073-8c53-70a61d6dbb96/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are running a paid study on corporate banking experiences and digital financial platforms used by businesses. The goal is to evaluate how financial leaders manage company funds, execute transactions, and interact with their primary banking interfaces. Your feedback will help shape the design and functionality of future financial management tools.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will complete a 25-minute online survey independently at your own pace. The survey will ask you to review various banking features, evaluate user interfaces, and answer multiple-choice questions about your daily financial workflows. You will also be prompted to provide short written responses detailing what works well and what could be improved in your current corporate banking setup. The entire process is asynchronous and straightforward.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for business financial decision-makers located in Brazil who actively manage corporate funds. We welcome Chief Financial Officers, finance directors, corporate controllers, and senior accountants. Ideal candidates will have hands-on experience using major Brazilian corporate banking platforms for their daily business operations.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete a 25-minute online survey independently.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Evaluate specific corporate banking features and user interfaces.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Answer multiple-choice questions regarding your daily financial workflows.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide brief written feedback on your current banking tools.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Based in Brazil</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Active role in business financial decision-making</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience managing company funds or corporate banking accounts</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with major banking platforms like Itaú or Itaú Empresas</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$63 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/d01f212d-a6c4-49cb-b33e-be29356c6ead?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe are running a paid study on corporate banking experiences and digital financial platforms used by businesses. The goal is to evaluate how financial leaders manage company funds, execute transactions, and interact with their primary banking interfaces. Your feedback will help shape the design and functionality of future financial management tools.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will complete a 25-minute online survey independently at your own pace. The survey will ask you to review various banking features, evaluate user interfaces, and answer multiple-choice questions about your daily financial workflows. You will also be prompted to provide short written responses detailing what works well and what could be improved in your current corporate banking setup. The entire process is asynchronous and straightforward.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are looking for business financial decision-makers located in Brazil who actively manage corporate funds. We welcome Chief Financial Officers, finance directors, corporate controllers, and senior accountants. Ideal candidates will have hands-on experience using major Brazilian corporate banking platforms for their daily business operations.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Complete a 25-minute online survey independently.\n\n - Evaluate specific corporate banking features and user interfaces.\n\n - Answer multiple-choice questions regarding your daily financial workflows.\n\n - Provide brief written feedback on your current banking tools.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Based in Brazil\n\n - Active role in business financial decision-making\n\n - Experience managing company funds or corporate banking accounts\n\n - Familiarity with major banking platforms like Itaú or Itaú Empresas\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$63 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/d01f212d-a6c4-49cb-b33e-be29356c6ead?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"792835d1-f1ff-42cb-b839-048de0c38ff4","title":"Sales And Revops Professionals: Interview On Workflow Tools","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-06T20:34:12.378+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/792835d1-f1ff-42cb-b839-048de0c38ff4","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/792835d1-f1ff-42cb-b839-048de0c38ff4/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on the workflows, processes, and software tools that power modern sales and revenue operations. We want to understand how teams manage data pipelines, align sales goals, and maintain their tech stack. Your operational experience helps us identify friction points in current revenue platforms.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will participate in a 30-minute virtual interview regarding your daily operational tasks and tool usage. We will ask you to walk us through your current technology stack, explaining how you manage data and support your sales teams. You will describe specific operational challenges you face and evaluate potential workflow improvements. The conversation takes place via a remote voice and video call.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are hiring professionals who actively manage sales and revenue operations at their organizations. We welcome Sales Operations Managers, RevOps Analysts, CRM Administrators, and Directors of Revenue Operations. You should be deeply familiar with the tools and processes required to keep a sales organization running smoothly.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Detail your daily sales and revenue operations workflows.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Discuss the primary software tools you use to manage data and processes.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Describe a recent challenge you faced while aligning sales operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Evaluate potential workflow improvements during a remote conversation.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Active role in Sales Operations, Revenue Operations, or CRM Administration.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on experience managing sales data and software tools.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable discussing operational strategies and team alignment.</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$100 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/7c78d86b-8120-4e3b-a3d6-dc44ca23485f?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on the workflows, processes, and software tools that power modern sales and revenue operations. We want to understand how teams manage data pipelines, align sales goals, and maintain their tech stack. Your operational experience helps us identify friction points in current revenue platforms.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will participate in a 30-minute virtual interview regarding your daily operational tasks and tool usage. We will ask you to walk us through your current technology stack, explaining how you manage data and support your sales teams. You will describe specific operational challenges you face and evaluate potential workflow improvements. The conversation takes place via a remote voice and video call.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are hiring professionals who actively manage sales and revenue operations at their organizations. We welcome Sales Operations Managers, RevOps Analysts, CRM Administrators, and Directors of Revenue Operations. You should be deeply familiar with the tools and processes required to keep a sales organization running smoothly.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Detail your daily sales and revenue operations workflows.\n\n - Discuss the primary software tools you use to manage data and processes.\n\n - Describe a recent challenge you faced while aligning sales operations.\n\n - Evaluate potential workflow improvements during a remote conversation.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Active role in Sales Operations, Revenue Operations, or CRM Administration.\n\n - Hands-on experience managing sales data and software tools.\n\n - Comfortable discussing operational strategies and team alignment.\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$100 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/7c78d86b-8120-4e3b-a3d6-dc44ca23485f?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"b7ca32ba-0dd0-45ae-9ae5-3e1007912ffe","title":"Head of Projects","department":"Operations","team":"Operations","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"San Francisco","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-04T20:18:29.259+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":false,"workplaceType":"OnSite","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"California","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"San Francisco"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/b7ca32ba-0dd0-45ae-9ae5-3e1007912ffe","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/b7ca32ba-0dd0-45ae-9ae5-3e1007912ffe/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the infrastructure for accessing human capability on demand. We are working toward a future where Terac deeply understands:</p><ol style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What every person is capable of, what they want, and where they can thrive</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What work our customers need completed and what success requires</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What creates a great match between the two</p></li></ol><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">With this understanding, Terac can intelligently allocate human capability to the work where it creates the most value for both our experts and customers. Today, our initial wedge is providing specialized experts for AI training, evaluation, market research, and other expert-driven research. </p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This future was not previously possible. Understanding people and work at this depth required more information and judgment than any organization could reasonably process. As a result, the labor market came to rely on crude proxies: résumés, credentials, applications, interviews, and personal networks. At Terac, we're changing this by making it possible to synthesize thousands of signals about a person’s knowledge, performance, preferences, and potential while developing an equally detailed understanding of the work itself.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We place 1,000s of experts per month, pay our experts, on average, over $90/hr. We're a team of 15 based in San Francisco, and we work with many leading research companies.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>About the role</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, Terac handles over 50 projects per month across 25+ clients. We're looking for a Head of Projects that can lead the team to hundreds of monthly projects across 100+ clients by the end of 2026. You will partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the delivery and customer success side of the business. You will work on the highest-priority problems in the company including managing key customer relationships, building the projects team from 5 to 20+, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>You will:</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead and manage a team of project leads and recruiters across multiple complex AI data and evaluation projects, ensuring clarity of ownership, priorities, and execution.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive on time, high quality delivery across custom data pipelines and expert labeling workflows, with a sharp focus on throughput, quality, and cost.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure a top tier experience for Terac Experts, enabling them to produce high quality, scalable data while feeling supported and informed.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner with Product and Engineering to evolve internal tooling, workflows, and systems that unlock step function gains in efficiency and quality.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own performance metrics across your portfolio, including quality, throughput, SLAs, utilization, and margin, and using data to drive continuous improvement.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><h2>You must have experience in:</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Operationally intensive roles such as marketplace operations, data operations, strategy and operations.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Managing high performing teams in fast paced, execution focused environments.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience leading complex, multi stakeholder projects from definition through delivery, ideally with AI, data, or technical workflows.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>You likely have experience in:</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Operations or strategy at early stage or high growth startups.</p></li></ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Investment banking, private equity or management consulting.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">AI data operations, ML ops, or technical services.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2><strong>Misc</strong></h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Compensation: </strong>Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.</p></li></ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div>","descriptionPlain":"ABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the infrastructure for accessing human capability on demand. We are working toward a future where Terac deeply understands:\n\n 1. What every person is capable of, what they want, and where they can thrive\n\n 2. What work our customers need completed and what success requires\n\n 3. What creates a great match between the two\n\nWith this understanding, Terac can intelligently allocate human capability to the work where it creates the most value for both our experts and customers. Today, our initial wedge is providing specialized experts for AI training, evaluation, market research, and other expert-driven research. \n\nThis future was not previously possible. Understanding people and work at this depth required more information and judgment than any organization could reasonably process. As a result, the labor market came to rely on crude proxies: résumés, credentials, applications, interviews, and personal networks. At Terac, we're changing this by making it possible to synthesize thousands of signals about a person’s knowledge, performance, preferences, and potential while developing an equally detailed understanding of the work itself.\n\nWe place 1,000s of experts per month, pay our experts, on average, over $90/hr. We're a team of 15 based in San Francisco, and we work with many leading research companies.\n\n\n\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nToday, Terac handles over 50 projects per month across 25+ clients. We're looking for a Head of Projects that can lead the team to hundreds of monthly projects across 100+ clients by the end of 2026. You will partner directly with the CEO to shape and scale the delivery and customer success side of the business. You will work on the highest-priority problems in the company including managing key customer relationships, building the projects team from 5 to 20+, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nYou're someone who thrives in ambiguity, has exceptional judgment, and can context-switch between strategic planning, tactical execution, and people operations.\n\n\n\n\nYOU WILL:\n\n - Lead and manage a team of project leads and recruiters across multiple complex AI data and evaluation projects, ensuring clarity of ownership, priorities, and execution.\n\n - Drive on time, high quality delivery across custom data pipelines and expert labeling workflows, with a sharp focus on throughput, quality, and cost.\n\n - Ensure a top tier experience for Terac Experts, enabling them to produce high quality, scalable data while feeling supported and informed.\n\n - Partner with Product and Engineering to evolve internal tooling, workflows, and systems that unlock step function gains in efficiency and quality.\n\n - Own performance metrics across your portfolio, including quality, throughput, SLAs, utilization, and margin, and using data to drive continuous improvement.\n   \n   \n\n\nYOU MUST HAVE EXPERIENCE IN:\n\n - Operationally intensive roles such as marketplace operations, data operations, strategy and operations.\n\n - Managing high performing teams in fast paced, execution focused environments.\n\n - Experience leading complex, multi stakeholder projects from definition through delivery, ideally with AI, data, or technical workflows.\n\n\n\n\nYOU LIKELY HAVE EXPERIENCE IN:\n\n - Operations or strategy at early stage or high growth startups.\n\n - Investment banking, private equity or management consulting.\n\n - AI data operations, ML ops, or technical services.\n\n\n\n\nMISC\n\n - Compensation: Competitive salary, meaningful equity vested over four years, $10K relocation bonus (for moving to the Bay Area), and an additional $5k housing bonus (if you move within 0.5 miles of our office), Health, Dental, Vision insurance, 401(k) with company match\n\n - Growth opportunities: You're joining Terac at one of the earliest stages and will have an opportunity to shape and grow with the company as a founding member.\n\n ","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"a9288ba7-c38e-461f-874b-5fe346a29716","title":"Professionals: 45-Minute Interview on Daily Workflows","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-05T01:38:08.644+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/a9288ba7-c38e-461f-874b-5fe346a29716","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/a9288ba7-c38e-461f-874b-5fe346a29716/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on the daily habits and common workflows of modern professionals. We want to understand how different roles manage their regular tasks and what processes they rely on to get things done. Your input helps us identify patterns in workplace productivity and pinpoint areas where typical workflows can be improved.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will join a 45-minute remote video call with a moderator. During the session, you will be asked to walk us through the tasks you perform most frequently in your current role. We will discuss the steps you take, the decisions you make, and the challenges you face along the way. You may also be asked to describe specific, non-confidential examples of your recent work to help illustrate your routine.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This study is for currently employed professionals who manage distinct daily workflows. We welcome individuals from a variety of industries, including technology, finance, healthcare operations, and general business administration. Candidates must be highly comfortable articulating their daily responsibilities and thought processes in detail over a video call.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Join a 45-minute remote video interview.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk us through the core tasks you handle on a regular basis.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Describe the processes, methods, and tools you use to complete your work.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Discuss common challenges or friction points in your daily routine.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Currently employed in a professional role with regular, distinct workflows</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable discussing your daily tasks and responsibilities in detail</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to join a remote video call with a stable internet connection</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Willingness to share non-confidential examples of your work processes</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$130 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/fac04f20-0179-4053-8b60-81eb4c609991?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on the daily habits and common workflows of modern professionals. We want to understand how different roles manage their regular tasks and what processes they rely on to get things done. Your input helps us identify patterns in workplace productivity and pinpoint areas where typical workflows can be improved.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will join a 45-minute remote video call with a moderator. During the session, you will be asked to walk us through the tasks you perform most frequently in your current role. We will discuss the steps you take, the decisions you make, and the challenges you face along the way. You may also be asked to describe specific, non-confidential examples of your recent work to help illustrate your routine.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nThis study is for currently employed professionals who manage distinct daily workflows. We welcome individuals from a variety of industries, including technology, finance, healthcare operations, and general business administration. Candidates must be highly comfortable articulating their daily responsibilities and thought processes in detail over a video call.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Join a 45-minute remote video interview.\n\n - Walk us through the core tasks you handle on a regular basis.\n\n - Describe the processes, methods, and tools you use to complete your work.\n\n - Discuss common challenges or friction points in your daily routine.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Currently employed in a professional role with regular, distinct workflows\n\n - Comfortable discussing your daily tasks and responsibilities in detail\n\n - Ability to join a remote video call with a stable internet connection\n\n - Willingness to share non-confidential examples of your work processes\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$130 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/fac04f20-0179-4053-8b60-81eb4c609991?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"c1d65416-25c7-4a8a-8db7-304cde2d5127","title":"Nurse Practitioners and Physicians: Payer-Sponsored In-Home Assessments","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-06T21:24:37.404+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/c1d65416-25c7-4a8a-8db7-304cde2d5127","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/c1d65416-25c7-4a8a-8db7-304cde2d5127/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on the specific workflows and challenges of conducting payer-sponsored in-home health assessments. By understanding how clinical evaluations are performed outside traditional medical facilities, we aim to identify friction points in patient data collection and care coordination. Your feedback will directly influence the design of future clinical support tools.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">During this remote interview, you will join a moderated video call to discuss your recent experiences conducting health evaluations in patient homes. We will ask you to walk through your standard assessment routine, from pre-visit preparation to post-visit documentation. You will react to several hypothetical scenarios and describe how you handle common obstacles in the field. The session concludes with a brief discussion about the software and medical tools you rely on most heavily.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are seeking licensed medical professionals who actively conduct payer-sponsored health evaluations in residential settings. We welcome Nurse Practitioners, Physician Assistants, and Physicians across various specialties who participate in these home-based programs. Ideal candidates have recent, hands-on experience navigating the unique clinical and administrative demands of in-home patient care.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Detail your step-by-step process for conducting health assessments in patient homes.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Describe the administrative and clinical challenges unique to field-based patient encounters.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide feedback on how payer-sponsored requirements impact your clinical workflow.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Discuss the technology and medical equipment you use during in-home visits.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Currently licensed as a Nurse Practitioner, Physician Assistant, or Physician.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Active or recent experience conducting payer-sponsored in-home health assessments.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable discussing detailed clinical workflows and administrative routines.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Available to join a remote video call from a quiet, professional environment.</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$200 one-time</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/af3e93ed-4404-4b56-8e82-8e1d8859329a?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on the specific workflows and challenges of conducting payer-sponsored in-home health assessments. By understanding how clinical evaluations are performed outside traditional medical facilities, we aim to identify friction points in patient data collection and care coordination. Your feedback will directly influence the design of future clinical support tools.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nDuring this remote interview, you will join a moderated video call to discuss your recent experiences conducting health evaluations in patient homes. We will ask you to walk through your standard assessment routine, from pre-visit preparation to post-visit documentation. You will react to several hypothetical scenarios and describe how you handle common obstacles in the field. The session concludes with a brief discussion about the software and medical tools you rely on most heavily.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are seeking licensed medical professionals who actively conduct payer-sponsored health evaluations in residential settings. We welcome Nurse Practitioners, Physician Assistants, and Physicians across various specialties who participate in these home-based programs. Ideal candidates have recent, hands-on experience navigating the unique clinical and administrative demands of in-home patient care.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Detail your step-by-step process for conducting health assessments in patient homes.\n\n - Describe the administrative and clinical challenges unique to field-based patient encounters.\n\n - Provide feedback on how payer-sponsored requirements impact your clinical workflow.\n\n - Discuss the technology and medical equipment you use during in-home visits.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Currently licensed as a Nurse Practitioner, Physician Assistant, or Physician.\n\n - Active or recent experience conducting payer-sponsored in-home health assessments.\n\n - Comfortable discussing detailed clinical workflows and administrative routines.\n\n - Available to join a remote video call from a quiet, professional environment.\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$200 one-time\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/af3e93ed-4404-4b56-8e82-8e1d8859329a?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"9aa15a3c-8bbc-4493-bf81-d7b32a0a0f8d","title":"General Participants: Paid Video Recording Study","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"Brazil","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:18:52.422+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"Brazil"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/9aa15a3c-8bbc-4493-bf81-d7b32a0a0f8d","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/9aa15a3c-8bbc-4493-bf81-d7b32a0a0f8d/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are running a paid study on video capture quality and on-camera user engagement. This research feeds directly into the development of new media capture features. We need participants to provide sample recordings to help us evaluate how different environments and lighting affect video output.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will use your own smartphone or webcam to record a series of short videos from your home. We will provide a specific set of prompts and brief scripts for you to read on camera. After recording, you will upload the files to our secure platform for review. The entire process takes just a few minutes and can be completed asynchronously.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome adults of all backgrounds and professions to participate in this collection effort. You need a device capable of recording clear video and audio, along with a quiet, well-lit space. No prior acting or professional video experience is required.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Set up a quiet, well-lit space for recording video.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Read provided scripts and answer short prompts on camera.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review your recordings to ensure clear audio and video quality.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Upload the completed video files to our secure platform.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to a smartphone or computer with a high-quality camera.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable recording yourself on video and sharing the footage.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to follow written instructions for camera framing and lighting.</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$2 per hour</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/13b5e202-2acd-422e-947a-225477b64c5b?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe are running a paid study on video capture quality and on-camera user engagement. This research feeds directly into the development of new media capture features. We need participants to provide sample recordings to help us evaluate how different environments and lighting affect video output.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will use your own smartphone or webcam to record a series of short videos from your home. We will provide a specific set of prompts and brief scripts for you to read on camera. After recording, you will upload the files to our secure platform for review. The entire process takes just a few minutes and can be completed asynchronously.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe welcome adults of all backgrounds and professions to participate in this collection effort. You need a device capable of recording clear video and audio, along with a quiet, well-lit space. No prior acting or professional video experience is required.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Set up a quiet, well-lit space for recording video.\n\n - Read provided scripts and answer short prompts on camera.\n\n - Review your recordings to ensure clear audio and video quality.\n\n - Upload the completed video files to our secure platform.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Access to a smartphone or computer with a high-quality camera.\n\n - Comfortable recording yourself on video and sharing the footage.\n\n - Ability to follow written instructions for camera framing and lighting.\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$2 per hour\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/13b5e202-2acd-422e-947a-225477b64c5b?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"26dae326-d2c8-4192-ad25-598e6c5aaf7c","title":"Advanced STEM Experts (PhD Level): Scientific Reasoning For AI Training","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-06T05:13:43.906+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/26dae326-d2c8-4192-ad25-598e6c5aaf7c","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/26dae326-d2c8-4192-ad25-598e6c5aaf7c/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're hiring advanced STEM experts to improve the scientific reasoning capabilities of sophisticated AI systems. This ongoing project focuses on generating highly complex, graduate-level academic problems with exact, verifiable answers. The work directly supports the development of models that can handle rigorous technical reasoning.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participants will create original graduate-to-PhD-level problems in their specific area of expertise. You will write a rigorous step-by-step solution for each problem, ensuring accuracy and logical flow. In some tasks, you may also review AI-generated responses to identify specific reasoning errors. The work requires deep subject-matter knowledge and careful technical writing throughout the process.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This opportunity is designed for individuals with deep subject-matter knowledge in technical disciplines. We welcome PhD candidates, PhD holders, postdoctoral researchers, and faculty members with strong analytical reasoning skills. Relevant fields include biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, and selected engineering disciplines.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Create original graduate-to-PhD-level academic problems in your field</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Write rigorous, step-by-step solutions with exact and verifiable answers</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review AI-generated responses to complex scientific questions</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify specific logical or reasoning errors in technical texts</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advanced degree holder or candidate in a STEM field</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep subject-matter expertise in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical reasoning and technical writing skills</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience solving, teaching, or developing advanced academic problems</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$100 per task</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/interview/start/r/cf586a67-122e-434b-8bdb-ba2a9e7efc26?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're hiring advanced STEM experts to improve the scientific reasoning capabilities of sophisticated AI systems. This ongoing project focuses on generating highly complex, graduate-level academic problems with exact, verifiable answers. The work directly supports the development of models that can handle rigorous technical reasoning.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nParticipants will create original graduate-to-PhD-level problems in their specific area of expertise. You will write a rigorous step-by-step solution for each problem, ensuring accuracy and logical flow. In some tasks, you may also review AI-generated responses to identify specific reasoning errors. The work requires deep subject-matter knowledge and careful technical writing throughout the process.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nThis opportunity is designed for individuals with deep subject-matter knowledge in technical disciplines. We welcome PhD candidates, PhD holders, postdoctoral researchers, and faculty members with strong analytical reasoning skills. Relevant fields include biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, and selected engineering disciplines.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Create original graduate-to-PhD-level academic problems in your field\n\n - Write rigorous, step-by-step solutions with exact and verifiable answers\n\n - Review AI-generated responses to complex scientific questions\n\n - Identify specific logical or reasoning errors in technical texts\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Advanced degree holder or candidate in a STEM field\n\n - Deep subject-matter expertise in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering\n\n - Strong analytical reasoning and technical writing skills\n\n - Experience solving, teaching, or developing advanced academic problems\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$100 per task\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now http://localhost:3000/interview/start/r/cf586a67-122e-434b-8bdb-ba2a9e7efc26?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"752f780a-a664-45a1-83da-fbd5ae6ffe0c","title":"STEM PhDs and Researchers: Advanced Problem Creation for AI","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-06T05:29:43.061+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/752f780a-a664-45a1-83da-fbd5ae6ffe0c","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/752f780a-a664-45a1-83da-fbd5ae6ffe0c/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are running a paid study on the scientific reasoning capabilities of advanced AI models. Our goal is to push the boundaries of how these systems handle complex, PhD-level problems in biology, chemistry, physics, and mathematics. This work directly feeds into developing more accurate and reliable technical reasoning engines.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will create original, graduate-to-PhD-level academic problems within your specific area of STEM expertise. For each problem, you must provide a single verifiable answer along with a rigorous, step-by-step written solution. You may also be asked to review AI-generated responses to identify specific logical or factual reasoning errors. The workflow requires careful technical writing and a deep commitment to academic accuracy.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are hiring individuals with deep subject-matter knowledge and strong analytical reasoning skills in STEM fields. We welcome PhD candidates, postdoctoral researchers, university faculty, and industry professionals with equivalent advanced academic backgrounds. Candidates must have extensive experience solving, teaching, or developing rigorous technical problems in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Draft original, graduate-level academic problems in your area of STEM expertise.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Write rigorous, step-by-step solutions with exact, verifiable answers.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review AI-generated technical responses to spot logical fallacies or factual errors.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Apply careful technical writing standards to all submitted materials.</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">PhD candidate, postdoctoral researcher, faculty member, or advanced STEM expert.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep subject-matter expertise in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience teaching, reviewing, or developing advanced academic problems.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to pass a project-instructions assessment and identity verification.</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$100 per task</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/interview/start/r/a308fcf5-856d-44ad-bde0-815376e62e81?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe are running a paid study on the scientific reasoning capabilities of advanced AI models. Our goal is to push the boundaries of how these systems handle complex, PhD-level problems in biology, chemistry, physics, and mathematics. This work directly feeds into developing more accurate and reliable technical reasoning engines.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will create original, graduate-to-PhD-level academic problems within your specific area of STEM expertise. For each problem, you must provide a single verifiable answer along with a rigorous, step-by-step written solution. You may also be asked to review AI-generated responses to identify specific logical or factual reasoning errors. The workflow requires careful technical writing and a deep commitment to academic accuracy.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are hiring individuals with deep subject-matter knowledge and strong analytical reasoning skills in STEM fields. We welcome PhD candidates, postdoctoral researchers, university faculty, and industry professionals with equivalent advanced academic backgrounds. Candidates must have extensive experience solving, teaching, or developing rigorous technical problems in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Draft original, graduate-level academic problems in your area of STEM expertise.\n\n - Write rigorous, step-by-step solutions with exact, verifiable answers.\n\n - Review AI-generated technical responses to spot logical fallacies or factual errors.\n\n - Apply careful technical writing standards to all submitted materials.\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - PhD candidate, postdoctoral researcher, faculty member, or advanced STEM expert.\n\n - Deep subject-matter expertise in biology, chemistry, physics, mathematics, or engineering.\n\n - Experience teaching, reviewing, or developing advanced academic problems.\n\n - Ability to pass a project-instructions assessment and identity verification.\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$100 per task\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now http://localhost:3000/interview/start/r/a308fcf5-856d-44ad-bde0-815376e62e81?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"7ede9f18-cb4f-4059-8140-84ecb87e0315","title":"Accounting Professionals: Interview on QuickBooks Workflows","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:23:48.450+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/7ede9f18-cb4f-4059-8140-84ecb87e0315","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/7ede9f18-cb4f-4059-8140-84ecb87e0315/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're running a paid study on how financial experts manage complex workflows within standard accounting software. Understanding these daily processes helps us design better tools for handling books, reporting, and reconciliation. The goal of this research is to see firsthand how experienced users navigate and optimize their accounting tasks.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">During this remote video interview, you will share your screen and walk us through a typical accounting workflow. We will ask you to demonstrate how you navigate the software to accomplish specific financial tasks. You will also discuss the workarounds you use and highlight areas where the interface either helps or hinders your productivity. The conversation will focus heavily on your real-world usage rather than hypothetical scenarios.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for practicing accounting professionals who consider themselves power users of QuickBooks. We welcome CPAs, bookkeepers, staff accountants, and fractional CFOs who rely on this software daily. Candidates should be comfortable sharing their screen and explaining the rationale behind their workflow choices.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk us through a typical financial workflow via screen share</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Explain the steps you take to complete complex accounting tasks</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Discuss your pain points and workarounds within the software interface</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Answer questions about how you optimize your daily routines</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Current accounting professional, bookkeeper, or CPA</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Power user of QuickBooks with extensive hands-on experience</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable joining a remote video call and sharing your screen</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to articulate the reasoning behind your workflow choices</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$70 per task</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/a9226369-c78a-489d-a243-910761576286?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe're running a paid study on how financial experts manage complex workflows within standard accounting software. Understanding these daily processes helps us design better tools for handling books, reporting, and reconciliation. The goal of this research is to see firsthand how experienced users navigate and optimize their accounting tasks.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nDuring this remote video interview, you will share your screen and walk us through a typical accounting workflow. We will ask you to demonstrate how you navigate the software to accomplish specific financial tasks. You will also discuss the workarounds you use and highlight areas where the interface either helps or hinders your productivity. The conversation will focus heavily on your real-world usage rather than hypothetical scenarios.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe are looking for practicing accounting professionals who consider themselves power users of QuickBooks. We welcome CPAs, bookkeepers, staff accountants, and fractional CFOs who rely on this software daily. Candidates should be comfortable sharing their screen and explaining the rationale behind their workflow choices.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Walk us through a typical financial workflow via screen share\n\n - Explain the steps you take to complete complex accounting tasks\n\n - Discuss your pain points and workarounds within the software interface\n\n - Answer questions about how you optimize your daily routines\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Current accounting professional, bookkeeper, or CPA\n\n - Power user of QuickBooks with extensive hands-on experience\n\n - Comfortable joining a remote video call and sharing your screen\n\n - Ability to articulate the reasoning behind your workflow choices\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$70 per task\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/a9226369-c78a-489d-a243-910761576286?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"c176c9e4-3927-445b-aa29-71e5f5d8eda1","title":"Marketing Professionals: Screen Recording for Salesforce Workflows","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:30:58.310+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/c176c9e4-3927-445b-aa29-71e5f5d8eda1","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/c176c9e4-3927-445b-aa29-71e5f5d8eda1/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are running a paid study to understand how marketing teams interact with enterprise automation platforms. Our goal is to evaluate the everyday usability of complex campaign management tools. Your insights will help us map common friction points and successful workflow patterns.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will complete an asynchronous screen recording session while navigating your typical marketing setup. We will ask you to walk us through a specific Salesforce Marketing Cloud workflow from start to finish. As you go, you will narrate your decision-making process and highlight any workarounds you rely on. The entire task is remote and can be completed directly from your own desktop.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome digital marketers, marketing automation specialists, and campaign managers with hands-on platform experience. You should be comfortable navigating Salesforce Marketing Cloud independently to execute daily tasks. We also encourage CRM administrators and email marketing specialists to apply.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Navigate through a typical Salesforce Marketing Cloud workflow</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Record your screen while narrating your step-by-step actions</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Explain the reasoning behind your campaign setup choices</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify any usability challenges or platform workarounds you encounter</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Active role in digital marketing or campaign management</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on experience using Salesforce Marketing Cloud</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable recording your screen and providing verbal commentary</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to articulate complex marketing workflows clearly</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$70 per task</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/6f267806-1541-4542-8593-056ad597aba6?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com\">terac.com</a> or on YouTube at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac\">@jointerac</a>.</p>","descriptionPlain":"WHAT WE'RE RESEARCHING\n\nWe are running a paid study to understand how marketing teams interact with enterprise automation platforms. Our goal is to evaluate the everyday usability of complex campaign management tools. Your insights will help us map common friction points and successful workflow patterns.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nYou will complete an asynchronous screen recording session while navigating your typical marketing setup. We will ask you to walk us through a specific Salesforce Marketing Cloud workflow from start to finish. As you go, you will narrate your decision-making process and highlight any workarounds you rely on. The entire task is remote and can be completed directly from your own desktop.\n\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nWe welcome digital marketers, marketing automation specialists, and campaign managers with hands-on platform experience. You should be comfortable navigating Salesforce Marketing Cloud independently to execute daily tasks. We also encourage CRM administrators and email marketing specialists to apply.\n\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\n\n - Navigate through a typical Salesforce Marketing Cloud workflow\n\n - Record your screen while narrating your step-by-step actions\n\n - Explain the reasoning behind your campaign setup choices\n\n - Identify any usability challenges or platform workarounds you encounter\n\n\nWHO SHOULD APPLY\n\n - Active role in digital marketing or campaign management\n\n - Hands-on experience using Salesforce Marketing Cloud\n\n - Comfortable recording your screen and providing verbal commentary\n\n - Ability to articulate complex marketing workflows clearly\n\n\nCOMPENSATION\n\n$70 per task\n\n \n\n\nREADY TO PARTICIPATE?\n\nStart your paid interview now https://terac.com/interview/start/r/6f267806-1541-4542-8593-056ad597aba6?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\n\n \n\n\nABOUT TERAC\n\nTerac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.\n\n \n\nLearn more at terac.com https://terac.com or on YouTube at @jointerac https://www.youtube.com/@jointerac.","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":null,"scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[],"summaryComponents":[]}},{"id":"8966a4b7-ae6b-414a-b7ed-5582612b42ee","title":"Sales And RevOps Professionals: Salesforce Sales Cloud Workflows","department":"Participant Recruitment","team":"Participant Recruitment","employmentType":"Contract","location":"United States","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":false,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:34:08.481+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressCountry":"United States"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/8966a4b7-ae6b-414a-b7ed-5582612b42ee","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/terac/8966a4b7-ae6b-414a-b7ed-5582612b42ee/application","descriptionHtml":"<h2>What We're Researching</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are running a paid study on everyday Salesforce Sales Cloud workflows. We want to see how professionals navigate the platform to manage their pipelines and daily tasks. This research helps us understand the practical friction points and efficiencies in modern sales operations.</p><h2>How It Works</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will record a brief video walking us through one of your standard workflows in Salesforce Sales Cloud. During the screen recording, you will explain your thought process and highlight any custom steps you take. We ask that you narrate your actions clearly as you move through the interface. The entire process is conducted asynchronously for your convenience.</p><h2>Who This Is For</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We welcome current Sales professionals, RevOps specialists, and Salesforce administrators who actively use Sales Cloud. You should be comfortable recording your screen and narrating your workflow aloud. Candidates with experience customizing or optimizing their own pipeline views are highly encouraged to apply.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Record a screen-capture video of your Salesforce Sales Cloud environment</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Walk through a standard daily or weekly sales workflow step by step</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Narrate your thought process and explain why you take specific actions</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Highlight any friction points or custom workarounds you use</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Apply</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Active Sales or RevOps professional</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Regular user of Salesforce Sales Cloud</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable recording your screen and speaking aloud</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiar with standard pipeline and account management workflows</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">$70 per task</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>Ready to participate?</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://terac.com/interview/start/r/9e4c3cc8-1303-4f12-982f-1ab333894b02?utm_source=ashby_listing_description\"><strong>Start your paid interview now</strong></a></p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><h2>About Terac</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Terac is building the world's largest pool of vetted human experts for AI. Researchers, AI labs, and product teams use Terac to recruit, screen, and pay study participants across industries, languages, and skill sets.</p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"> </div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learn more a